    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "it feels unfair giving the cut version of this a rating but lord the way the censor board butchered this movie is insane. like 9 mins were cut out of the movie and damn near EVERY action scene got cut down, makes the movie feel like it’s jus edging u every time an action scene starts sorry that’s a nuts way to describe it 😭😭😭. \n\nik the censor board alr violated captain miller asw, the climax got cut by 4.5 mins ☠️ but im hoping that doesn’t affect the UK release, we’ll have to see though",
