    "review": "I NEED A GIRL SO BAD 😭😭😭\n\nthis movie was so adorable man, i had butterflies in my stomach jus watching the relationship of dq and nithya evolve. they had GREAT chemistry, genuinely idk how these guys don’t fall in love shooting these movies lmao by the third day i’d have proposed to nithya. (she looks absolutely gorgeous in the movie asw 😍😍😍) \n\nthe music : i was already obsessed w the soundtrack for time, so it was great when the songs came on especially my favourites (malargal kaetten, naane varugiren and theera ulaa). the SCORE too, the first half i actually didn’t like it cos it had the edm/techno vibe i guess that i wasn’t enjoying at all, but in the second half where it became more melodic it was beautiful. especially the alternative versions of theera ulaa and malargal kaetten were SOOO beautiful, but the score is nowhere to be found online 💔\n\nthe cinematography lowkey i didn’t like it as much, it felt kinda amateaurish but i know this cinematographer isn’t an amateur, so i guess its was going for a more casual breezy approach to match the tone of the film , which would make sense. it also doesn’t help that it’s hard to find a good quality print of the film after it got removed from netflix, so i had to find some knacks 1080p version from online. \n\nthe performances by everyone were great, i alr touched on dq and menon but prakash raj and bhavani’s actor were both outstanding too, the portrayal of alzheimer’s was REALLY accurate to reality which made the emotional connect even stronger for me. the movie in general was really really relatable, a lot of the choices the leads had to make in the closing third of the movie reminded me of my own life which only added to the emotional stakes even more. n this film is EMOTIONAL, it didn’t make me cry (only 3 movies have) but it did make me deep life a lot. it’s really good at making you feel emotions, which is a staple of ratnam’s movies because the first half where it’s the beginnings of their relationship are sooo happy and it reflected onto me asw i was cheesing the entire film lmao. \n\ndefo a very very good film n im glad i finally watched it. soo cute also ananya’s actor was sooo beautiful asw",
