    "review": "this movie is SOOOO HARD \n\nunfortunately i didn’t get to enjoy it as much as i could’ve BUT ITS MY FAULT i went straight after work n didnt nap, so i was fighting to stay awake during the movie 😭😭 and some guy was beefing me cos the cashier gave me my popcorn first (???) n he was starting to get physical so that made me a bit shook for the first like 10 mins of the film lmao \n\nanyway the movie itself is COLD!!! icl i only went cos of shobitha , it was cool seeing her in a hollywood movie but dev patel , bro he’s SICK. ALL the fight scenes were so well done n the camera movements were 😍😍😍. especially the ones in the boxing ring , the fights feel SO up close and personal and intimate and tense , cos it moves around and flips around so much and stays right next to the actors too. the sound design was TT asw, that scene near the start where 151 rum plays was 🔥🔥 especially hearing it in the cinema man ouffff. this movie is just so cool , yk? some of the camera effects when he’s like dazed and everything kinda blurs out were REALLY interesting too. the flashbacks that r kinda dropped in every now n then that allude to patel’s past are about as deep as the story goes but who cares; nobody’s watching this for the story , we’re watching for the SUPER stunts. redlining the auto was crazy asw, that car chase was actually really fun and added a bit of variety to all the gory fighting. also the colour grading really stood out to me, everything was vibrant and pretty to look at except for when they’re in the boxing place, everything is monotone and ugly and grimy except for the blood that sticks out a lot, it was a nice contrast imo. i read that they had huge budgeting issues and they had to use phones and gopros for some scenes , and i didn’t notice that AT ALL , except for a single like 5 second scene which did kinda break immersion but if that was a compromise they had to make jus for the movie to be made , bro i DONT care everything else makes up for it massively. i almost wanna watch it again to appreciate it fully but i am broke . can’t wait to watch it again on digital, fantastic movie n defo worth the time n money. dev patel n shobitha 😍😍😍😍😍",
