    "review": "what the FUCK is this \ni went into the movie blind i only read the synopsis thing n it sounded pretty cool, i didnt know ANYTHING else about it. but FUCK me i wish id watched the trailer or something to properly understand the vibe of the movie cos it wasn’t what i was expecting at all, but tbh it was kinda my fault. i saw the 18+ rating n assumed it was gonna be like conjuring/insidious level of scary movie but NO ! 💔💔💔 it was LAME and BORING ! i think the biggest downfall of the movie was the fact that it tried too hard to be funny , like there were certain moments when u could literally tell the director was like “pause a bit after this line so the audience can laugh” bro SUCK YOUR MUM only like 2 of the jokes were funny , and there were only like 6 other ppl besides us in the cinema so it was bare quiet , made the jokes even more awkward 😭😭. \n\nalso some of the cast were REALLY annoying , the frank guy tries to be this super cool kinda mysterious person but it doesn’t work at all n he jus comes off as pretentious and jarring and the fucking wham elon musk clone as well , he was more bearable but he was only in there for comic relief and again it took away from the scary experience i was expecting. the cinematography and music was pretty nice tho i can say that much. OH YEAH the visual effects were REALLY cool, probably the reason the movie got an 18 rating. mild spoilers but there’s a scene where a person explodes and it looks so cool the way blood splatters everywhere. but that lowkey might be everything good i have to say ab the film lol \n\nalso the movie is BARE long , its only 1.45hours but it feels like it goes on for EVER, i remember i thought i was like 20 mins from the movie finishing but i checked my watch n it showed only 50 mins had passed since the film started 😭 i hated it in there. however the leading actress melissa i think her name was is super leng lmao abi said she was really good in scream before she got fired (3palestine 3eelam) so i might have to watch some of the other movies. giancarlo was a massive surprise but he was in the film for like five mins so don’t watch the movie specifically for him . lowkey i only watched it last night but ive alr forgotten 70% of the movie so thats all i can say ☠️☠️ soha gave it a 4 n abi gave it a 7. for me its like a 4.5 , nice start but it just drags and drags for so long",
