    "review": "holy shit man i haven’t posted on here for ab 300 years anyways i have GOT to start sleeping after work \n\none of my boys abi is OBSESSED w harry potter so when he saw a tiktok saying this movie was rereleasing, this guy didn’t even let me say i had work he jus booked the ticket 😭 n i haven’t seen the harry potter films before except the first one in primary school one time , so i had to catch up on the first two films in 5 days , which SHOULD’VE been light. \n\nexcept i forgot to watch the fucking movies ☠️☠️ so i had to watch a ten min recap in wingstop jus before the movie. also i came from work in the morning (night shift) and i SHOULD’VE slept but agajn i forgot to cos i was too busy playing ps5 (HORROR decision) . so i went into the screen and yk , i was excited to see the film , its my boys favourite franchise so it must be good (even tho he stopped la la land halfway thru stupid prick) but brother. those hot wingstop boneless wings and cajun fries filled me up n gave me the itis , and then on top of that the nice dark quiet room, bro the FUCKING vue recliner seats were SO plush. the way sleep was calling my name 10 mins into the movie ,  i was fr fighting myself to stay awake cos i wasn’t tryna disappoint abi 😭.\n\ni acc made it thru to when the dementor bruddas got onto the train asw (COLD scene btw, i thought it was gonna be like a horror movie so i got excited) but then after that i don’t even remember what happened cos i could feel myself drifting away. bro all i remember was my eyes closing n then THROWING my head forward cos i didn’t wanna sleep and Ya Allah like ten mins of the movie had gone by i didn’t even clock. apparently i was fucking SNORING during the movie holy shit 😭😭. my apple watch said i was sleeping the whole film asw what a fucking liar anywyas i need to watch the whole series fr one day cos this is supposedly the best out of the series n i flipping slept thru it 😭. \n\nthere were some cool scenes tho , like the train scene i mentioned and when they did the going back in time thing to free that dragon don , like beakback or something idk (it’s been 2 weeks since we went i jus forgot to post review) n i saw one of my letterbox friends go thru all the hp movies so i feel like i need to asw. anyway gonna try go to that new vjs movie hopefully wont sleep thru that asw we’ll see tho",
