    "review": "holy banger i wanna watch the 2nd one but none of my boys are on it they’re too cool 💔💔. might go watch it on my ones cos this movie was lowkey really funny and KINDA EMOTIONAL TOO WTF \n\npuberty in the second movie is gonna be so crazy but i’m actually sick cos my first thought was “r they gonna introduce Horny or nah”\n\nthe whole moving thing lowkey meant a lot to me cos im moving out for uni in october to the DRIEST ENDS OF ALL TIME BRO what the FUCK is there to do in warwick 😭😭 some made up region fr im gonna miss ldn a lot especially the fucking cinemas man i’d never be able to watch a small movie like maharaja or thangalaan in coventry EVEN BIG FILMS like leo or kalki are gonna be in the most meady screens ever what the fuck 💔 not even mentioning my boys im gonna see them like once a month AND ILL HAVE NO CAR WHAT THE HELL ☠️☠️☠️ gonna be demoted to a #BrokeBusBoy 😭 i even wanna take another gap year jus so i can stay in ldn with my fam oh my God im gonna miss my cats too fuck",
