    "review": "work in 2 hours and a canny sleep n the cars in the shop so i need to take uber 😣😣 vague spoilers btw \n\nanyway this movie was bare cool however not as super scary as all the reviews made it out to be. it felt more like unsettling than SCARY but i guess my type of horror that i like is more jumpscarey than the disturbing type. lowkey concerning cos im going to longlegs tmrw n its more this type of horror , so i might not enjoy it 😭. however i did still enjoy the film a lot and the cinematography was beautiful and there were a few moments that REALLY got  me. peter’s reaction in THAT car scene, the part where the mum stares into the dark n there’s a person but then when she turns on the light it disappears??? CRAZY. ALSO THE CEILING SCENE! that really got to me\n\nalso that soundtrack at the end was fucking PHENOMENAL it sounds soooooo good i was listening to it so many times today. but lowkey besides that i don’t have much else to say ab the movie it didn’t affect me as much as i wanted it to. im still gonna give midsommar a go though . need james wan to return man, if conjuring 4 isn’t directed by him im killing EVERYONE bro the first 2 r literally my favourite horror movie ever",
