    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "☹️💔\n\ni really want pa ranjith to do a full on romance movie cos my favourite bits out of his movies i didn’t enjoy (this and NN) were the romantic scenes, they genuinely feel like a tier or two above the rest of the film in terms of quality. \n\nhonestly maybe i just need to rewatch the film or something but i genuinely had no FUCKING idea what was going on for like 70% of the time, from about 25 mins in after the white guys first appear i was COMPLETELY lost. \n\ni really did like a lot of the match cuts they used, BACK TO BACK too, absolutely phenomenal editing. however the good editing ends w that cos besides that a lot of the cuts felt super abrupt and at times it felt like how it is when the censor board chops off scene AFTER the edit is finalised. \n\nalso unlike capt miller g v prakash did REALLY well here. the bgm as usual was fantastic, it did help elevate the fight scenes but gvp’s always been good at that. i haven’t enjoyed his music in a while but the war song is a BANGER and minikki minikki was also rly good, especially its placement in the movie. \n\nanyway the movies biggest downfall is its poor writing , like i said a lot of the runtime i just didn’t understand what was going on and the ending felt like it was really shoehorned in n was a massive pisstake . vikram n parvathy as expected were RIDICULOUS they just disappeared into their role, it was cool seeing something rly different from malavika too. \n\nspoiler section !!! ⚠️‼️⚠️‼️⚠️i still don’t understand WHAT exactly was happening during those match cut fight scenes. were they switching between present day and past tense? (to when his grandpa was fighting arathi) or were they switching between reality and his hallucinations? \n\nok bro icl this movie pissed me off so much maybe i’ll give it another try when it comes to ott 😭😭😭 i PRAY that sarpatta 2 ends up being nearly as good as the first, that was the movie that made me so interested in ranjith in the first place but every movie besides that that i’ve seen has been fucking boring ☠️☠️ need to watch madras. ok bye",
