    "review": "was gonna write some mega review for this movie but i actually can’t be arsed bra i watched on second day w laigini bro i was having the WORST DAY EVER OMG ok na im venting \n\ni was tryna call my accom to try get my room key n i was on hold for 1.5 hours n when they FINALLY FUCKING answered they told me i called the wrong number so i waited 90 mins no reason 😂😂😂😂😂😂 n my car broke down 2 weeks ago n garage said it’d be ready today i went there n then they were like acc wait like one hour n itll be fixed so i WAITED n then they were like ngl thambi u need to come collect tmrw BUT BY THIS TIME THE MOVIE WAS FUCKING STARTING IN 50 MINS so i had to take bus from CROYDON TO FUCKING WANDSWORTH FAM n i was also bare hungry so i had to stop to get maccies so i came to the movie late 🔥🔥🔥 PUNDAI garage fam y are tamil ppl so lazy!!! oh yeah lmao after the movie ended i dropped laigini off at the bus stop n my parents arrived that VERY SECOND BRL IMAGINE I GOT CAUGHT LMAO PERMA BANNED FROM EVER GOIJG OUT 😭😭😭😭\n\nanyway after the movie was over i went in tamilgum go see how much of the movie i missed i ended up missing first 27 mins 🔥🔥🔥 including that beautiful title card🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥 n i didn’t even REALISE they introduced the villain alr so i was jus bare confused the whole second half \n\nn i never realised how much of a gaaji pediyan i look like in my review until niki read them all but good FICKING LORD THE WOMEN IM THIS MOVIE 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 i was TWEAKING BRO SNEHA, JEEVAN SKSTER AND JEEVANS GIRL all UNBELIEVABLE LENGERS GOOD LORD. nah like okay lowkey this is the most gaaji pediyan post ive ever done but nah sneha was so so so so beautiful in the movie n i was like rah but i didn’t REALISE HOW ULTRA MEGA SUPER LENGERS MEENAKSHI WAS BRO WHAT THE FUCK?!?!?!?!?!? sorry if i write more about the women than the movie itself thats actually insane bro my bad\n\nshe was SOOOO leng tho\n\nspoilers btw ❌❌\n\nanyway ab the movie itself first half is bare funny n hella action scenes n kutty vijay reveal was HARD and intermission title card was COLD asw but then it jus got worse. in second half yogi babu was jokes but literally everything else was so fucking boring bro especially the ending i swear i thought the movie was gonna end so many times but it just kept going ON AND ON AND ON AND ON AND ON fucks SAKE😭😭 also the fight scenes looked cool yeah but were choreography was literally booty cheeks bro u could NOT follow what was going on at all most shaky cam of all time. also some of the b roll looked like it was filmed on an iphone 6 fam wtf. yeah anyways meady movie\n\noh yeah fucking worst music ever ever and EVEN WORSE song PLACEMENT BRO WHY DID THEY FUCKING PUT THE SOMGS THERE 😭😭😭😭 n the bgm was also booty cheeks i’m so glad ani is music for t69 lowkey want sana to work w him one more time tho cos as bad as a movie as it was bairavaa had a nice soundtrack \n\nanyway yeah shit movie but super duper MEGA ULTRA INCREDIBLY gorgeous actresses oh yeah lowkey incredibly vijay performance too gandhi n jeevan were rly contrasting characters i liked how he managed to perform both characters so well 😄 oh yeah post credit scene pissed me off too bro that was jus some stupid unecessary bullshit bra \n\nmeenakshi hit my line pleaaaaaassseeeee😭😭😭😭",
