    "review": "believe it or not until last year i didn’t realise this was the og , i thought bangalore naatkal was 😭😭😭 didn’t even know this movie existed \n\nBN was lowkey my favourite comfort for like 3 years straight so i was p excited going into this n like i expected its a BANGER , so cute like i was acc cheesing for like 70% of the movie i love it\n\nlowkey kind of insane to say but i prefer the tamil version ☠️☠️ acc no who am i kidding arya and sri diva AND EHEN bobby were all SHIT yeah i take it back og is better \n\ni’ve gotten far too lazy to do anything now like i watched goat 4 days ago n i still haven’t written review bro what has happened to me \n\nmusic so so cute downloaded the entire album alr\n\nhad a massive crush on nazriya since raja rani n this jus made it 100x stronger",
