    "review": "no way its on boxd bruv why does this website only have miniseries on here be a man and put all the tv shows anyway ep.1 review \n\nactually wait quickly not to sound like a grumpy old man but i hate how everyone tries to be class comedian on boxd like the madagascar penguin jokes were funny at first but like give it up guys wtf 😭😭😭 anyway sorry had to let that out \n\nBANGER fam \nloooove how visually similar it is to the batman , i thought greg fraiser came back for a sec bro. lmao im so dumb the entire first 30 mins i was like why's it so orange the whole time i had my fucking night shift on lol anyway i LOOOOVE the whole like vibe of it, super reminiscent of the batman and suprisingly REALLY REALLY funny bro omg. i watched it 2 weeks ago now so lowkey forgot all the specific jokes but that one pickle joke actually got a laugh out of me lmao the visuals do NOT make you think this show would be funny. im not clued up about the whole batman lore at all let alone the penguin so im sure there was bare references to the comics that i didnt catch but the whole show feels really detailed, every shot is really well composed and each scene feels like the perfect length. omg that title card was so fucking HARD bro the penguin theme is amazing and i loved where they decided to put the card too. L review bruh sorry i genuinely forgot most of what happened but the prosthetics on colin  bro what the HELL 😭 and the ACCENT??? ive only seen him in the gentleman so far which is like a SUPER thick irish accent and he actually like looks like a normal person 😭 like i remember watching the interviews for the batman after seeing the movie and not having a clue what role colin played in it, thought i was tweaking lmao. also that fucking new york accent is so insane bro i tried to copy it and didn't get a single word right fam. \n\nending was sooo good, reminded me of the breaking bad pilot ep this was a great way to start the show and i think that ending was suuuper important in displaying how smart he is, also that prosthetic again wehre he was naked was ridiculous holy shit. back to the ending lol it instantly made me far more curious as to how the show was going to go, i mean i think i would've watched the whole show regardless cos batman unvierse but that ending made me like THINK about the show for a  bit after it ended, like tryna study the character they're presenting Oz as. \n\n!!!!!! mild spoilers below !!!!!!!!\n\nfeels like a super multilayered charcter study cos on one hand you have this man who feels like insecure about his physical disablilty and doesn't want people to view him as a burden; this was implied really cleverly when they're on the subway and they show him staring at that disabled seat and refusing to sit on it, but on another hand he's kinda disloyal as he's working with all the different players in gotham, but on the other hand he's also a super quick thinker and very intelligent shown by the ending. idk bra im really excited for how this series is gonna go",
