    "review": "no spoilers \n\nHOOOOOOOOLY SHIT DUDE UNEXPECTED 10/10!!!!!!!! \n\ni’m so unimaginably ridiculously incredibly mad i didn’t go watch this in cinema cos they were showing at lstr square imax too bro IMAGINE WATCHING THIS IN THAAAAT BIG OF A SCREEN???? FUUUUUCKIN ELL\n\ni literally remember asking the guys if they wanted to go asw n stupid prick pundais said nah i should’ve jus gone on my ones \n\ni don’t think ive ever felt SO energised n happy throughout the entire duration of a movie before. this could be ridiculous recency bias speaking right here but this is defo in my top 10 movies of all time n there COULD be a case for top 3 , but i need to rewatch to be sure. speaking of rewatch there’s a FUCKING EXTENDED CUT??? LETS GOO I NEED TO WATCH. \n\nsorry bra i need some type of form n rhythm to my reviews cos rn i literally jus waffle for bare long until i cant type anymore let me try section this off \n\nryan n emily : YOOOOOOO W CASTING ryan gosling was lowkey the main reason i wanted to watch this film and he absolutely did NOT disappoint; i do think his botox doesn’t suit him that well n he looked better before, but his hair has gotten WAYYY better. he was actually super leng in this movie but let me chill lol. anyway emily\nblunt u knew this was coming bra gaaji pediyan she was SOOOO GORGEOUS with her BRITISH ACCENT TOO??? 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 this is so bad mind of me but like first 20 mins of the movie i had to keep replaying scenes cos i was too focussed on emily instead of the acc film lmao. but nah her actual acting was great too. ryan’s too bro why the fuck am i talking about how they LOOK instead of their acting 😭😭 ok nah their chemistry i actually really enjoyed, like i fell for the little situationship thing STRAIGHT away. bro some of the emotional scenes i ACTUALLY got a little sad lmao if they took this to a la la land ending direction i ABSOLUUUTELY would’ve cried. they were so cute together. \n\nalso the movie was really really fucking funny bro it reminded me of the nice guys a bit, ryan’s great in these comedic roles bro someone stop him from doing literally me characters abeg. but yeah i laughed a LOTTT the entire time like i was literally grinning w my teeth on show the entire runtime it’s soo cute and soo fun and like. just great yk. bro im so bad at fucking writing reviews lmao what am i talking about \n\nmusic was super great too and the movie was FLIPPING GOOD LOOKIMG BRO, W COLOUR GRADING WTF. i downloaded a 25GB print bra my storage was STRUGGLING n im so glad i did. the entire aesthetic of the film was just super beautiful, even in the little mock movie they showed at the end. i loved that they had bts scenes in the credits too, bts n bloopers r a lost art form 💔. ngl bra im gonna have to write a proper review when i rewatch it + extended cut cos im lowkey so overwhelmed by the PEAK cinema i just watched. also lowkey all of the actresses in the movie were hot. also i like the whole message/like idk purpose of the movie to give more credit to stunt guys OH YEAH WTF all the STUNTS WERE SOOOOO SICK TOO i’m not tryna spoil it obviously but EVERY ACTION SCENE WAS 🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯 WIIIILD\n\nOH YEAH LMAO when he’s listening to that taylor swift song in the car that was lowkey a banger song i had to shazam it\n\nalso it’s so cool ryan acc did a few of the stunts , staying true to the core message of the movie what a banger. gonna watch bullet train next , ppl hyped that movie up bares too i hope it’s as good as this one. ok byeeee love u guys",
