    "review": "no spoilers\n\nANOTHER FUUUCKING BAAAAAANGER DUDE WTF\n\ni really really really like this style of movie n i absolutely can’t wait for this directors next movie good gosh. also WTF BRO I DID NOT FUCKING REALISE lemon and prince ARENT FUCKING ENGLISH????? WTF 😭😭😭😭😭 ok lemon he looowkey broke like once or twice like the way he says innit wasn’t quite convincing but i STILL THOUGHT HE WAS ENGLISH and fucking prince???? NO english in her??? WIIIILD WTF 😭 also fucking tangerine dude bro aaron taylor johnson. i’ve only seen him in this movie and the fall guy and icl im the fall guy he was so fucking meady like his role had no substance or comedy or villainy or anything he was just a blank slate so i thought he was jus another average actor but LEMON TANGERINE COMBO YOOOOO!!! both of them were super funny ! aaron (tangerine) i loooved his exaggerated cockney accent n making it so purposefully hyperbolised fits in so so well with the style the movies going for, the sort of hyper realism comedic genre. he was also just really funny in general that sort of dead pan humour he has (i mean i think it’s deadpan it might jus be british humour lol) idk man he was lowkey my fav character in the whole movie. apparently lemon LEARNED his accent from aaron which is sooo fucking cool bro even if he does like completely drop it out of nowhere in some scenes. their whole duo was so fucking funny dude especially with the whole thomas the tank engine inside joke thing they had going, i LOOOVE how many times they would call back to it later in the film too. lowkey i don’t even care about the rest of the cast bra these two were so flipping hilarious. brad pitt was p funny too but not as funny as ryan in the fall guy but we don’t need to compare lol they’re both great. but lowkey ryan is one of the best at action comedy . \n\nanyway the making of the movie again SOOOOOO beautiful dude like the fall guy had great vibrant colours but bullet train is like that turned up to the MAAAAAAX especially with all the neon colours man. sooo pretty especially in the close up scenes where the neon’s super harsh it’s just visually really striking. the 15 was absolutely deserved , the gore was actually like FUN (sounds so insane out of context but watch the movie you’ll see what i mean). again cos of that hyper realism like the gore in Kill was cool but it was uncomfortably cool, cos it was REALLY realistic. also just the tone of that whole movie lol but bullet trains SUPER stylised, constantly upbeat tone makes it far easier to digest the violence for even a family audience. i always feel like im missing something when i write these reviews man oh yeah another thing the soundtrack was PEEEERFECT !!! this director has a knack for finding great music n placing them in the best spots in the run time too. icl added the album to my library like straight away. not to be super lame n shit but today was lowkey the worst day ever , EVERYTHING went from for me today but this movie genuinely cured me 😭😭. my problems are not fixed tho so it’s back to horror tmr morning but until then 😄😄. also those cameos were super unexpected but super welcome, i gasped like a little girl when i saw them lol. ALSO YOOOO the white death betrayal scene was SOOOOOO cinematic dude like all those flames , and the roulette to his OWN head , the red mask , fighting in that pure white snow, SOOOO GOOD LOOKING DUDE i lowkey wish we spent more time there. i honestly can’t be arsed to go over the negatives but the film slyyyly dragged in the middle like i couldn’t belive the film was only 2 hours it felt closer to 2.30 😭. but yeah man super banger i love how they transitioned from one subplot to the next , the editing was sooo good. cgi looked a teensy bit video gamey at times  but literally who cares bro its JUST FUN !!!! need more movies like this man that was great. \n\nanyway gonna watch next ep of the penguin now bye guys love u",
