    "review": "cried at that one scene then the ending made me really happy \n\nso i started writing a really long review but it got so personal i started crying again 😭 \n\ngreat movie though , so crazy that it was written by ben and matt too \n\nreminded me of when i used to go counselling mine was not nearly as good as robin williams 😭😭\n\nreally really loved that one conversation they had about not regretting loving people. it’s been the topic of a lot of my journals lately so it was kinda weird in a comforting way hearing it in that context. idk i think i really needed a movie like this and im glad i found it\n\noh yeah and the one about not feeling perfect n then robin was like “it’s about whether u guys r perfect for each other” idk bra so much of the counselling sessions felt reminiscent of my own sessions back in the day so i lowkey spent a lot of this movie looking back at my own past instead of focussing loool \n\nand matt’s friend group asw man i miss my guys from ldn a lot yk . first year feels really lonely\nlove u",
