    "review": "this movie is so so so cute , i was genuinely smiling the WHOOOOOLE way through and lowkey ive been feeling like poo the past 3 weeks and this gave me such a comforting feeling the whole way through \n\nicl it’s 4.30 am n i absolutely adored this movie but i fr don’t know what to write lol the music is absolutely beautiful and so was the cinematography , loved all the shots of cats that was so cute too . kinda annoyed they trimmed some of the run time i rly wanted to see the leads spend more time together . bro arvind was at the O2 for fdfs wtf !!!!!!!! i miss ldn so much man they weren’t even showing this in cov. might go back to see amaran ANYWAY i had a lump in my throat the entire second half of the movie. much like 96 the storyline is really basic but the performances of the leads + the incredible writing makes this a really soul touching (idk if thats a phrase) movie. \n\nkarthi’s hair was also so leng bro thats exactly the hair im tryna grow mine into rn that kinda modern mullet style sorry im waffling again. YOOOOOO WAIT that one scene when they’re at the dam n the caustics r reflecting off arul 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍  normally i start my reviews in the notes app n like refine them but im lowkey jus typing in a flow rn this could be my worst review of all time \n\nalso the movie was surprisingly funny like i was laughing out loud a lot at the start bro this is just really heart warming if id watched this last week in my super depression era i think i would’ve cried for like an hour straight \n\nfree eelam love u guys 🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽\n\noh yeah it was bare cool when there was a 96 poster in the bg lol y did so many ppl like this review bra i should’ve written something more introspective 😭😭😭 was just waffling for bare long",
