    "review": "baaaangerrrrr \nlately i’ve only been feeling like peaceful when im watching a movie it’s acc a problem 😭😭😭😭 \n\nthis movie is so so cute tho n made me super nostalgic about last year , the little friendship group they had and the long road trip made me think ab last winter for sooooo long dude i wanna go back to london so bad . cov is super lonely n but a new friendship group is coming soon InshaAllah i will never be lonely again 🤞🏽 \n\nanyway i really love this movie n that train scene is my fav scene in the entire film , sachin’s SO vulnerable and him expressing his feelings like that was adorable bra cant wait to do that myself \n\nsuper funny movie asw i need a bredrin like amal davis in my life loool i lowkey dk what else to say which i didn’t alr say in the first review , im still not a fan of how their relationship concluded (not the long distance thing that was cute) but the whole making reenu feel bad for rejecting sachin still felt like it wasn’t the right direction to go in \n\ni’m SOOOO excited for the second one now , espec to see how they’re gonna explore this whole long distance thing cos ibr being in a long distance relationship is in my top 3 biggest fears ever like it might be scarier than being in croydon on ur ones after 2am loool \n\nstarted this movie at 3am cos i’ve been completely unable to sleep lately i went to bed at 8.30am last night 🙏🏽🙏🏽 i ordered some magnesium pills to help me sleep bra what has uni acc done to me 😭😭😭😭😭 anyway im lowkey super waffling love u guys",
