    "review": "💔\n\nwanted to love this movie so bad every post i saw ab it presented it as a hopeless romantic movie ab loss / heartbreak and i guess it kinda was about that but i just didn’t care about the characters like at all , no matter how hard i tried \n\nthe movie is STUNNING though , the colours were gorgeous and more than that the way the camera would move and was framed was genuinely incredible for every scene. some of the visual effects they used with the slow shutter were GOOOOORGEOUS like this is top 10 prettiest movies ive ever seen but FUCK me i could never bring myself to rewatch it cos it was a real slog to get thru. \n\ni feel like this is one of those movies ur supposed to “feel” more than ur supposed to understand it, like a ‘vibes’  type of movie but i think i can’t like zone out completely to let myself enjoy that ygm.  feels like my brains jus running at 100% 24/7 so it’s hard to concentrate on the movie \n\nim sure it’s a great story but im not in the right place mentally rn to watch something like this . the first time i watched interstellar i was at the lowest point in my whole life n i HATED that movie , n i think it might just be the same w this one. when im normal again i think ill rewatch also that one song was doing my head in bro good gosh\n\nok wait lol an hour later im back n one thing about faye’s character that REALLY resonated with me is her obsession w loud music; ever since i moved into uni i have music playing every second im awake, even if im jus going down to the kitchen to make tea or something even for like a 3 min activity i’ll bring my airpods in to keep my mind busy. like i haven’t sat in silence in so long , nowadays even when i go to sleep i have a playlist of like movie scores playing. even when im journalling which is supposed to be the time my mind is most focussed , i have some type of song playing in the background n i dont necessarily think its a bad thing but ive lost my ability to jus sit by myself with no distractions n i dont know why . ok wait now im not even talking ab the movie loool mb",
