    "review": "soooo cute bra \n\nending is lowkey bare sad\n\nok im back like 2 days later lol it was really funny bro i absolutely love vjs as a villain (vikram vedha 😍😍😍) but i LOOOOVE him when he’s acting as a unserious silly guy \n\nthat dream sequence was so sad fam when it cut to black after vjs got stabbed n said a few months later (idk i can’t read tamil) i was getting MEGA la la land ptsd bro , i love and hate that they ended the movie where they did \n\nit was also super super funny , the “naaya? naana???” was FUCKING HILARIOUS LOOOOOL \n\nwas also so cute when he was cooking for her n stuff acc i just loved how they made vjs appear, not vulnerable but like, soft compared to the rogue life he actually lives when yazhini’s not around. i love being in love bro \n\nspeaking of the rogue life i feel like some of the gang stuff lowkey could’ve been cut out that’s just me tho . loved the bit where he saved manikandan from becoming a gm tho , it added quite a bit to the selflessness of vijay’s character \n\ni’ve started to love watching these types of movies so much bro im not gonna watch a ‘serious’ movie for ages",
