    "review": "guys were saying this is nelson’s best but this was FAR worse than doctor imo and on par with jailer. let’s not even consider beast loool \n\nit’s actually wild how his style changed visually from coco to doctor tho, coco still has the deadpan/dark humour that his current movies have, and some of the interesting framing choices are still there but not NEARLY as thoughtful as they are in doctor. if anything thats just a testament to how beautiful i find doctor tho, the colour grading and camera movements and composition, basically every visual aspect of doctor is phenomenal like it’s such a 😍😍😍😍 movie. sorry i’m supposed to be talking ab coco lol it’s a good movie jus wasn’t as good as ppl were hyping it up to be \n\nicl i patterned my sleep schedule a bit too well bro last week i was staying up till 5-7am light work it’s only 1am rn i was struggling to stay up during the movie 😭😭😭😭\n\nim spending too much time watching movies nowadays i didn’t do ANY work today i",
