    "isLiked": true,
    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "BANGEEEERRRRRRRR \n\nthis is also top 3 ani albums imo it’s kinda crazy that his best 3 albums (imo) are his first three 😭😭😭 i feel like there’s an element of nostalgia to it like that one drake interview where he was like “do you want my music to go back to sounding like that or did it just drop during a time in your life that you wanna go back to” idk i explained that poorly but this, 3 and ethir neechal were lowkey THE soundtracks of my 2010’s so everytime i hear a song from those albums i feel like im a kid again. idk could be reaching tho but besides a song of two i haven’t really listened to any of ani’s new music recently i hope he comes back with a bang 🤞🏽🤞🏽\n\nanyway REALLY funny movie again and i’m starting to really really love these ‘easy going’ movies , they’re really fun to watch and again a lot of nostalgia comes with it too so its just a really fun 2 3 hours . maybe its L attention span from me but i LOVE that i can take a 5 min break in the middle of the movie and not like break all immersion like you don’t need to give the movie 100% of ur attention \ni’ll be so honest agila ugila super star and priya were NOT that good here 😭😭😭😭😭😭 especially priya’s accent bro she needs to retire that NOW unless that’s actually how she speaks english then i feel so bad loool \n\nlowkey shiva made the same 4 emotions throughout the whole film but he’s a CHARMING guy man i can’t wait for thamizh padam 3 . i liked the dynamic they had too like i LOOOOOVED the haters -> lovers arc cos when u can see them start to show a little bit of paasam 🤭🤭🤭🤭 so cute da . \n\nalso priya is unbelievably gorgeous but i said that enough in ethir neechal review mb 😭😭\n\nspoilers fr \n\nOH YEAH bro UNEXPECTED W CINEMATOGRAPHY WTF ?!?!?!? bro MIRROR SHOT IN OH PENNE WAS 🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯 the one scene where she’s in the mirror n shiva appears and then deepak appears after WAS THAT PRACTICAL ???? super sse side b vibes fam that was CRAZY ! the whole song was nuts tbf with all the perspective illusion stuff they locked in so hard there\n\nunfortunately the last 20 mins completely lost me icl i can’t even explain why i just lost interest during the solo santhanam comedy track 😭😭😭 until then he was bare funny tho i was laughing out loud a lot during the entire movie \n\nanyway back to the music i went to this bollywood vs south india club event n they played chennai city gangster bro I HAVENT HEARD THAT SONG IN YEAAARSSSS WHAT A BANGER why have ani n aadhi not collabed in so long bra . ethir neechal title track is the best thing the south n north have made together in like EVER \n\noh penne has sooooooooooo many memories attached to it but even beside that it’s actually such a beautiful song bro. and ailasa ailasa ?!?!? i didn’t even know that EXISTED till last year SOOO GOOD !!! lately hey has been my fav tho its soooo uplifting and in the comtect of the movie asw its such a cute song . im lowkey waffling now mb bye",
