    "isLiked": true,
    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "deeksha rec\n\nok bro before anything the FUCKING MUSIC HOOOOOOOLYYYYYYYYY\nthe soundtrack is great like its my most played album of november (w only a week of playtime how is that possible bra) BUT THE SCORE????????????? FAAAAAAACKIN HELLLL it might be the best score i've ever heard for any movie bro maybe it's recency bias but this is the EXACT kind of soulful relaxing melodic music im into , i've been RINSING it for the past 3 weeks it's genuinely so well made. now i lowkey wanna watch hridayam just cos its the same composer\n\nthis movie was the start of my nani era , eega is the only movie of his i've seen so far i didn't know what i was missing out on cos he was GREAT in this !!! i get why the call him natural star now bro i feel like this movie demanded a lot of subtle acting from nani and he pulls it off w ease, like all the early scenes with mahi he's tryna hide his true emotions from his kid and that sort of internal conflict is SOOOOO well done. my fav example of this is when mahi asks him to say the amma kathai and he shuts the door and you can tell JUST from his body expressions how he feels. gosh i loved nani in this \n\nSPOILERS !!!!!!!!!!!\n\ni loooooooved the way they weaved mrunal into the flashback, cos i was expecting it to be a second actress but the way they did it flows with the story SOOOO well especially cos they'd alr set up the \"who does mahi imagine each character as\" thing. ngl at first i felt a little iffy about where the story was going cos i thought it was a \"men never move on from their first love\" situation which is DUMB, but that brings me to my next point\n\nHOLY FUCKING PLOT TWIST LOOOOOOL bro this movie did NOT go the way i imagined it, it's one of my sister's n mum's fav movies n i haven't seen any of the promo so i thought it was jus a chill love story. HELL NAH 😭😭😭😭😭😭bro i even asked deeksha for a nice happy romance movie n she recommended this WTF bro it's been a couple weeks since i watched but that intermission twist holy SHIT bra ok wait even before the plot twist bro that TONAL SHIFT WTF???? it was just cutie putie nani and mrunal in love awww then fucking THE BABY HAS A DISEASE????? then that scene of them crying in the hospital bro wtf💔💔💔💔 THEN THE FUCKING CAR CRASH??????? that's when i clocked yo this is NOT a happy love movie n as if i wasn't in enough shock varsha IS YASHNA BRO WHAT THE HELL😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭\n\nok gonna speedrun the rest of the review ive been typing for bare long\n\nmrunal absolutely STUNNING and beautiful and gorgeous and SO BELIEVABLE TOO? i liked her in sita ramam but she lowkey wasn't given much to work with but here she had a lot of screen time and made the most out of it too bro like the scenes where she's halfway in between remembering her past w viraj but also still slyly in love w arvindh GOSH THATS PAINFUL MAN\n\nthe bioluminescence beach scene sooooooooooo gorgeous i wanna go see one of those  irl so bad\n\nanyway let me say the flaws super quick\n- mrunal falling for nani and calling off her WEDDING in seven days is a little INSANE NO???? but tbf it does kinda depend on how much of her memory was coming back\n- the ending where the doctors who save mahi's life was arvindh's family felt SOOOOOO on the nose bro like it felt a little too much like \"we need a disney-like super happy ending where everything works out\" n it kinda took me out of the story for a bit\n- mrunal's mum was super annoying to watch bra she literally had ZERO redeeming qualities but i guess she is supposed to be the villain of the story",
