    "review": "icl i literally started this like 2 hours after finishing memories of murder bro that pundai padam genuinely ruined my entire day 😭😭😭wasn’t tryna end the day like that so i tried to find this but FUUUUCKING hell bro it’s not on 1**7x OR 1t*milmv (am i allowed to write those websites on here lol) so i had to ask my friend to get it off a TELEGRAM BOT bro that’s SUPER PIRACY WTF 😭😭😭😭😭 anyway \n\nbro when i say this movie is funny this is FUCKING FUUUUNNNNYYYYYYY there’s 2 bits i was actually laughing out loud for AGES but spoilers 😖😖\n\nthis movie is the start of my nazriya era 🫣 nazriya is so cute bro i can’t keep track of how many times ive said this but i acc fell in love w her after this movie , i even followed her on insta after 😭😭 bro her pics w fafa are SOOO CUUTEE THEYRE SOOO IN LOVE\nanyway she was really good in this movie and she carries the humour SOOOOO well , n she shows that silly energy so easily but i think she might just be that irl lol  \n\nmusic is so cute and mandaarame is SOOO FUN ! the two chorum neram songs (what’s actually the difference between them lol) are beautiful too\n\nalso WTF UNEXPECTED INCREDIBLE CINEMATOGRAPHY?!?!!  like i thought it was just a cute little chill movie but some of those shots were SOOOOO CREATIVE like there’s this one shot where she’s standing and the transition to the next scene is the BED RISING UP FROM THE GROUND N THE BLANKET FLOATING UO AND THE LIGHTS DIMMING BRO WTF 😭😭😭😭😭 horror explanation but when u watch it it’s acc 🤯🤯\n\ni also love that the movies from a woman perspective, it kinda puts into perspective how underdeveloped the love interests r in most masala movies bro like nivin pauly was fucking BORING 😭 that sounds harsh but his character just doesn’t do anything yk , besides this one scene he’s lowkey just there to be leng but i deeped thats what the women in a lot of movies are \n\nfuck this bro SPOILERS TIME !!! i need to talk ab these two scenes so bad \n\nfirst that one scene where nazriya’s asking to go out n her dad’s like nah stay AND THEN VILLAIN MUSIC PLAYS n she speaks in some proper deep voice n intimidates her dad bro WHERE DID THAG COME FROM 😭😭 n then it just e\nnever happens again that was so funny bro but THE FUNNIEST BIT IN THE ENTIRE MOVIE??? \n\nCHINESE NIVIN PAULY 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 bro i was fucking CREASING LOOOOL “chum chim chao” arguably the funniest dialogue ever said in any movie ever n lowkey maybe racist 😭😭😭 like no way that was real chinese right LOOOOOL bro i recorded that scene n sent it to all my friends that was SO funny \n\nall of the characters were funny bro the running gag about nazriya’s dad asking his bro to come see all the greenery was so funny cos that’s literally the only dialogue he has w him also HER COUSIN TOO HE WAS HILARIOUS bro this is PEAK comfort movie\n\nalso i love how short it was but even then i loooooowkey zoned out a bit i forgot when but im super gonna rewatch this i loved it",
