    "review": "UNEXPECTED FUCKING BAAAAANNGEEEERRRRRRR \n\nicl i was about to leave this review as jus a bunch of bullet points but be so serious it’s not a rath review if it’s not unnecessarily long and full of waffle\n\nthis movie is SO funny bro like SSO SO SO SO SOOOOO funny . bro for almost THREE HOURS straight i was jus cheesing hard as FUCK or laughing at something like it’s actually just 170 mins of joy i LOVE this movie\n\nmy nani era jus started cos of hi nanna and nazriya era jus started cos of ohm shaanti oshaana so IMAGINE MY FACE when i found out there's a movie w BOTH OF THEM AS LEADS???? they have AMAZING chemistry man the first 90 mins was actually so adorable , bro i actually couldn’t stop myself from smiling. it felt like i was watching one of my friends fall in love like i was rooting for them SOOOO hard 😭😭. nani’s also SO funny bro im super watching gang leader after this , he’s also super charming i was getting sk vibes from him is that jus me . also nazriya is SOOOO so good bro she’s really like goofy/silly idk what the word is bra she’s charming like it’s just fun seeing her on screen 😭 i can’t believe this is only the third time i’ve seen her. all the characters ive seen her play r PEAK comfort characters !  she’s also insanely attractive sorry for being gaaji pediyan but im acc in love w her sorry again \n\nlowkey they felt more like besties than a couple but that might jus be cos there was like zero physical intimacy between them but IDC theyre still sooo cutie putie !!\n\nalso HOLY CINEMATOGRAPHY 😍😍😍 the grading was acc stunning and the set design and framing LIKE EVERYTHING bro the film is just SO PRETTY TO LOOK AT. also i love the theme with the text , like that retro comic book style thing it was unique and really suits the vibe the movie has . anyway the cinematography bro there’s this one scene where there’s 4 people on this table and the tables like spinning around n theres that symbolism of the wheels turning in this plan they’re creating and they’re LITERALLY TURNING IRL TOO okay it sounds so dumb in writing BUT IT WAS SOOOO COOL especially cos the lighting was beautiful at like every angle. but a lot of the shots were just super beautiful and all the locations are super vibrant it’s genuinely such a beautiful movie to look at \n\ni was super intimidated by the runtime going in but those 3 hours FLEW past bro, besides a small bit i’ll talk ab later i did not find myself checking the time or going on my phone ONCE bro thats lowkey super disappointing of me tho lol\n\nthe non-linear storytelling is so funny asw , ibr at times i was confused where we were in the story especially cos at the start of the movie it was like “pay attention to these fast forward n rewind sounds” but i didn’t hear them ONCE during the film 😭😭 i was ab to say that’s acc such a creative idea. anyway its so funny when we’re in the middle of a story and we cut to nani telling the story like these one on one scenes were SOOOO funny bro this is where nani shows his comedic ability best cos it’s purely dialogue and it’s still so hilarious . \n\nthe only point in the movie where i felt like i was zoning out was when it tried to get a little more serious in the final 40 ish mins but that’s only for like 10 mins out of the 170 and as soon as we go back to the silly energy it becomes so much fun again \n\nfor as unserious as the movie is though it actually created tension REALLY well in that final hour , especially cos they kept WITHHOLDING EVERYTHING FOR SO LONG and there were SOOOOOO many mini plot twists too. like i have a shit attention span but it held my attention span so well and i was so nervous for them near the ending i didn't go on my phone ONCE in the entire 3 hours do you know how RARE that is for me\n\nunfortunately the soundtrack is lowkey meady besides rango ranga that song has mega sana vibes + thera theesindhi is SO beautiful and sad i've been ABUSING it the past few weeks\n\nmild spoilers !! \n\ni LOOOVED all the callbacks to earlier points in the movie , like guru the doctor, playing the veena, and MOST IMPORTANTLY THE 🖖🏽 BRO THAT WAS SOOOOOOO CUUUUUTEEEE😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 \n\nthe child actors were INCREDIBLE bro and they had SO much chemistry with the leads too, the scenes where all four of them were together were some of my favourite scenes. actually it was my FAVOURITE bit of the whole movie i was waiting for them to come back so bad, that post credit scene made me smile SOOOOO HARD. i LOVE how they always wear the same stuff as the leads too AND YOOOO that one scene when they’re at the cafe the leads r talking to each other but in the bg the kids are taking pics of each other 😭😭 so cute man . \n\nalso that scene when both of the parents meet for the first time was SOOOOOO well written bro \n\nthis is exactly what i've been searching for the past month, i can't believe it took me so long to watch this i remember seeing it on netflix when it dropped n i never paid it any attention cos my mum said it was boring SILLY AMMA BRA. gosh i needed this movie so bad bro i might rewatch this for my birthday lol. peak comfort movie it's been like 3 weeks since i've seen this and NOTHING has made me as happy as watching this movie did. possibly recency bias but top 5 movies EVER?!?!?!?!?!?!?",
