    "review": "BANNGERRRRRRR \n\nbro that intermission shot was SOOOOOO HARD w him in the drivers seat n the rest of the gang in the window kf the back seat 😍😍 come ONNNNN MAN \n\ni loved when they would let a scene play out n it goes really wrong but then it cuts to him typing on his computer , the first time they did it w the ACB officer was SOO funny . icl when they did it w the villain coming in n killing everyone i didnt believe it for a SEC BUT THE REVEAL WAS STILL SO COOL \n\nalso i super stole this bit from niki’s review but i looooove how he became what each person lost, like he became saranya’s son , he became priyanka’s husband , etc etc . the entire family dynamic i loved so much man i wasn’t expecting to care about these characters as much as i did . bro chinnu’s birthday celebration??? i started getting BARE EMOTIONAL LOOOL WHAT THE HELL I THOUGHT I WAS GONNA CRY😭 . and the bit where nani lowkey broke down n was like if u guys leave ill be an orphan again i was like ☹️☹️☹️ ahhh i dont wanna jus recap the entire movie but it was a really fun ride bro nani was also REALLY REALLY GOOD. i still think ante was the funniest role he’s played and hi nanna was the most emotional but this was like a mix of both + making him bare intelligent too i love pencil. i REALLY wanna see the rest of his movies but the rest sound like rly serious movies / weren’t received well 😭😭 . also lowkey best nani look ever ? those earrings r sooo leng on him \n\nALSO the scene where dev goes to nani’s house one thing i REALLY liked was how in the version nani was writing, when he went up that one step it broke from the weight of him standing on it, but for the real version it broke cos he was STOMPING up each step n i loved nani’s reaction to it too, kinda realising that he miiight be underestimating the villain \n\nthe villain was lowkey my least fav part of the movie cos he felt super duper generic but it’s whatevaaaaa \n\ni was ready to zone out completely during the fight scene cos i’ve just lost interest in action movies lowkey 😭😭 but jt was REALLY GOOD the stunts were so cool especially all the slow mo shots like with the mini drill that was super interesting. also straight after i finished this i had to watch the raayan intermission fight bro thats actually PEAK FUCKING CINEMA DUDE n the score w that one chant where dhanush appears 🤤🤤🤤🤤 anyways\n\nalso i’m so fucking stupid lmao i kept hearing that one motif n i was like bruv did ani steal this from that dharalu prabhu song n then the song played at the end HE JUST REUSED THE SAME SONG IN TAMIL FOR THE HARISH MOVIE LOOOOL \n\nidk what movie to watch next bra im running out of south indian romcoms😖😖😖 the english ones jus don’t hit the same also lowkey been a while since i watched a tamil movie fam wtf . wanna watch a nazriya movie i miss her\n\nnikis acc on a winning streak bro's only recommending bangers (except past lives LOL)",
