    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "icl i’m not smart enough to understand this movie 😭😭😭 lowkey embarrassing cos im doing an econ degree but whateva life update at the end !\n\nREALLY good tho , the first thing that comes to mind is how PRETTY the movie is bro . all the sets were so realistic n the camera guys were having the time of their lives inside that bank lmaooo they were starting shots from the top corner of the room n pulling it down n then tracking the actors like bro those are COMPLEX moves wtf 😭 all the new telugu movies i’ve seen , especially this and gang leader have this really distinct colour grading to them where everything is blue and hazy , and it’s SUPER appealing . i love love LOVE how they cranked up the grain on this movie asw to make it look like it was shot on film , goes really well with the set design n costumes to make it really feel like 1980 . \nmight jus be me but in the bright shots it was sooo noisy kinda felt like a yt video. might jus be netflix compression tho \n\nspoilers !!! \n\nngl i know it goes w the time period but i didn’t like dq without a beard 😭😭😭  he was SOOO 😍😍 in the end tho holy fack also MEENAKSHI??? YOOOOO also guys were saying her acting was bad but i thought she was soooo good here , i was acc rooting for her a lot when dq became a bit snobby like when he mashed up patel bhai’s scooter . one side of me was like “patel bhai pooooooosi u deserve that” but when i saw meenakshi i instantly felt ☹️ especially when you realise she’s acc been there for him since he was BROKE . also she’s actually stunning like she’s BEAUTIFUL sorry\n\nOH YEAH i LOOOOOOVED the 4th wall breaks they were SOOOOO WELL DONE!! bro during that montage where they first start PROPERLY spending i was getting happy like I WAS the one earning the bread 😭😭 as if i didn’t spend an hour debating dropping £30 on a zip up on black friday loool\n\nbro that scene after he trusts anthony for the first time n he started overthinking all the ways it could go wrong was so funny he’s literally me . even though the movie didn’t really dive that deep into it i loved how they explored greed , especially w the arrogance it brings. was it jus me or did this movie have MEGA kurup vibes ?? that was the first dq move i ever saw in cinemas n i remember i actually had a mega crush on him not to glaze but he had so much aura in that movie loool\n\nok i kinda forgot the rest of the movie gvp was golden again tho he’s on a winning streak u love to see it. bro the cbi officer when i saw he was the same actor as nani’s dad i  saripodha i got so mad i hate that actor so much idk why 😭😭 \n\noh yea the scene where he shows the amex made me so vexed bra ive been tryna get one for AN ENTIRE YEAR BRO MY CREDIT SCORE IS 970 WHAT MORE DO THEY WANT FROM ME😭😭😭😭😭😭I JUST WANT A GOLD METAL CARD\n\nanyway life update !! \n\ndidnt even realise i watched a movie everyday the last eight days bro thats CRAZY i wanted to keep the streak going but i flopped 💔💔 icl for a good reason tho i actually went outside for once lol got invited to a club in fucking NOTTS n charlotte got us free tickets 😍😍 she bought alc asw n this is my second time EVER drinking n icl bro 😭😭😭😭😭 FAAAAAAACKING HELL I WAS COOKED LOOOL ok nah this life update is gonna be longer than my acc review\n\ni had 200ml of smirnoff which i THOUGHT wasnt a lot cos last time i had like 3 cups of capt morgan n was tipsy at most but BRO? ngl it was a super last minute plan so we couldnt go pres n had to sip in the uber n i didn’t feel anything at all ? UNTIL i stepped out the car FUUUUCK fam as soon as i got out i jus felt bare heavy like all my movements were super delayed . when we were waiting in the queue bro id jus be standing n out of the blue feel like i was ab to fall im SO lucky george is a heavyweight bra i had to keep grabbing onto him lmao. anyway we got in and i had to piss like FOUR times the first hour bro wtf anyway i’ve been clubbing before but fully sober (didn’t like the taste of alcohol lol)  , it’s SOOOO fun going drunk WTFFFF i was acc dancing w RANDOM people bro i am SO antisocial WHERE DID THAT COME FROM !! n then JAYDEN came too bro i havent seen that guy in 18 MONTHS 😭 but then he moved to some white girl cos he’s a #Whore! bare people from wcgs were there it was like a lil reunion so cute. also bro i got a notification from my watch that my heart rate was 196 BRO WTF IS THAT PHYSICALLY POSSIBLE ?!?!? anyway after we got maccies n we took uber back n i was acc so talkative , there were 2 extra ppl who i didn’t know but i was having good convo w them we’re all boys now. we were singing 2000’s r&b songs otw back bro that was SO FUN also uber there n back was like £160 y didn’t we jus go to a club in cov 💔💔. when we got back to accom is when i was FUCKED tho , this was like 7am so it’s been like 10 hours since i drank but my heart was still like 120bpm bro also i lowkey felt like i was gonna vomit bare scary. i’m p sure i had the longest piss of my entire life when i got back bro i drank SO much water. \n\nicl tho i didn’t feel an urge to text my ex or anything loool idk how people do that (yk who u are 🫣) . that was the most carefree night ive had in so long ibr i can’t believe i missed out on all the clubbing events at the start of uni man i could’ve had sooooo many friends😭😭 i hope this doesn’t start my alcoholic era tho loool i used to think ppl who go clubbing all the time were super weird but like 🤭🤭 i wouldn’t mind going a couple more times before end of year . \n\nanyway last week of uni then im back to london idk y im acting like been working bare hard as if my attendance isn’t single digits bro i flopped term 1 so bad its acc heartbreaking bruh i have ZERO uni friends 💔💔 i hope it’s not too late for me. i have a massive urge to watch ante sundaraniki and ohm shanti oshaana again ok bye love u",
