    "review": "having a job is the most loser shit ever bra ive acc lost all my energy kmt i miss when i was unemployed (2 days ago) \n\nEDA MONE !!!! \n\nanother baaaangerrrrr \n\nwhen the movie ended i was lowkey really sad ?!?!? as in i missed all these characters so much bro it wasn't even a sad ending but i was having such a good time and having fun w all these characters , i jus wanted to spend more time w them😭😭even all the side characters felt so well written and created such good energy , i really hope they make some type of sequel for this \n\nbro sushin shyam FUUUUCKING hell he genuinely locked in SO hard for this movie bra, i only even watched this movie tn cos i heard 'jaada' and ive acc never heard my speakers make that kinda bass before in my LIFE. bro HOOLY SHIT THAT SONG IS INCREDIBLE!! and then i had to listen to the entire album bro illuminati, armadham, galatta there's SO MANY bangers in there \ni thought the album was good, but holy shit the score is INSAAAAAANE it's SO unique and SO vibrant and complements the film so well. i cant think of any more adjectives fam it was super enjoyable to listen to and elevated the movie a LOT\n\nspoilers !!!!!!!\n\nbut obviously the star of the show is fafa and HOOOOLYYY i wanted to hold off on watching this movie a bit cos everyone was saying it's for fafa fans and i've only seen like 2 of his films but IT DIDNT MATTER the SECOND he enters the film you can FEEL HIS AURA (no glaze). he's just SO eccentric especially compared to the other times i've seen him (bangalore vikram n vellaikaaran) where he's quite reserved, but in this he's just so OUT THERE bro!! through the entire first half he's sooooo fun to watch and icl when people said there was no plot to the movie they're lowkey right but fafa and his whole crew are SO enjoyable to watch you don't even realise it. i LOVE how easily he switches between this silly guy jus watching n making silly reels , and this menacing VILLAIN with like 40 loyal guys under him. all the scenes in the bar where he yells and EVERYONE stands up to listen were so funny. LOOOL when anbam kept shooting the floor w his gun and they all jumped in sync was hilarious EVEN THE FIGHT SCENES WERE FUNNY when ranga would go up to all his goons n be like \"break his legs\" \"punch his teeth\" DUDE the scene where ranga gets the 2 girls for the boys n he looks in through the window n they show him tip toeing on the two barrels😭😭😭😭😭 ok nah i dont wanna jus recap every funny scene\n\ngoing into the second half we finally start to see his facade break a little, when he answered bibi's phone n his whole demeanour changed when his mum said \"are you happy son?\" ibr i was getting sooo ready to cry 😭 in the short 40 mins we'd spent with ranga i was already so invested in his character , the first time seeing him be a little vulnerable was SOOOO sad bra and sushin again with that piano bgm 😍 and again in the climax where he fully breaks down bro i actually felt sooooo paavam cos where's all that silly energy gone 💔 that emotional aspect added a lot to the movie cos the goofy menacing character was very entertaining yes but giving him a bit of vulnerability elevated both the film and the character by a tooonnnn\n\nalso ANBAM LMAOOOOO bro ranga was funny but ANBAM WASNT FAR OFF bro i actually dont know how to review this movie lmao its just FUN for so long OHYEAH the intermission holi fight 😍😍😍😍😍 ESPECIALLY when u see fafa running and them anbam overtakes him and then THE KUNG FU FIGHTERS LMAOOOOOOOO OH YEAH THE FUCKING GRANDPA LOOOOL nah this movie was FUNNY bro im laughing just writing this review . i cant believe i got asked to go watch this in cinemas n i said no 😭 to watch MONKEY man bro that was a good movie but this was PHENOMENAL\n\nthis was so close to being a 10 but it unfortunately loses SO mcuh momentum when the boys go to that other hostel and leave fafa. when everyone was saying fafa carried the movie i didn't really feel that until we spent such an extended time away from him; all of that chaotic humour was gone and it felt like i was just waiting for ranga's return. it does pick back up when he's back on screen but not to the level it was on before 💔 \n\noverall this is firmly in top 5 of the year i think my ranking rn is\npremalu, maharaja then this",
