    "review": "almost cried like 5 separate times bro wtf \n\nnani’s son was sooo good , also i deeped nani when he’s acting as a father is when he’s at his best , this , hi nanna and gang leader are all SOOOOOOOO good . the child actors in all those films were phenomenal too but this was by far the most emotional of the 3 . it’s so so painful seeing how much he wants to provide for his son but he’s jus unable to and he’s pushing away everyone he’s close to . when u deep it this is lowkey a depressing movie 😭😭😭 when he starts playing again tho that’s SO goated , also rewatching after you know how it ends makes it WAY more sad bro nani actually locked in for this movie . top 3 performances from him ?? ngl tho i didn’t see the ending coming at ALL LOL maybe im just dumb but that ending speech was 💔💔💔 n the scene of them tryna take a selfie on the beach man i loved this movie . i do like how they didn’t make it a super dramatic like plot twist about his death but at the same time if they DID do that i think i absolutely would’ve cried . i hope i get out of my own rut soon im living like 35 yr old arjun rn 😭 \n\nani’s score was lowkey disappointing ngl 😭😭felt too much like it was made for a mass movie which i didn’t feel the film was going for\n\nnow i need to revise for micro tmr but how am i supposed to move on from this movie bra (spoiler i didn’t revise and flopped SO HARD bro i came out the exam hall n guys were saying “i think i got 100% prolly 80 tho” bro idk if i even PASSED😭😭😭😭😭😭)",
