    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "ishu and arshu rec u guys have matching names lmao \n\nyo this is lowkey my worst and longest review of all time icl jus skip to the spoilers bit im jus waffling until then , i super need to rewatch this movie cos there’s SOOOO much stuff going i lowkey forgot a lot of it😭😭😭\n\nalso the name of this movie is ridiculous bra do yk how much of a pain in the ass it was trying to write this with my TV REMOTE BRO i got it wrong like 18 times also amazon prime ads mid movie is insane \n\nANYWAY HOOOOOOOOOOOLY BANGERRR !!!! \n\nicl i was kinda hesitant to watch the movie cos i didn’t recognise any of the main cast but WAIT WHY AM I LYING LOL BRO ROCKY AND RAMBO FROM ANTE N GANG LEADER !!!!!!!! especially rocky bro idk how to say this without sounding incredibly gay but every time ive seen him he just screams comfort character, like he’s jus a chill guy yk \n\nalso the movie is REALLY FUNNY bro im ngl i watched the movie over 2 days cos i fell asleep bro my sleep schedule is TOO good rn, i keep falling asleep at 8pm n waking up at 4 sorry im YAPPING OMG\n\nSPOILERS!!!!! ❌⚠️⚠️‼️\n\nanyway first half icl its still good but it PALES in comparison to the second, but they set up SOOOO much stuff in the first half that it’s all worth it in the end. like theres so many small quirks they set up like rahul always losing his phone , one of the kidnappers needing a skl bag , bro the PRODUCER LITERALLY SAYS THE INTERVAL WAS MINDBLOWING BRO HOOOOOOLY SHIT😭😭😭😭😭 all of these have the most satisfying payoffs later on in the film bro i acc don’t remember any of the first half im gonna jus talk ab 2nd half\n\nBRO FINDING OUT R3 AND SHALINI STORU WAS HAPPENING AT THE SAME TIME 🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯 even tho vishal shows the script n none of the names match up it was still a cool reveal  \n\nidk HOW but vivek manages to fit like 3 separate storylines and like 8 characters and make me care about EVERY SINGLE ONE and i love how there’s no explicit villain and you kinda root for every one (besides rk) , this is most obvious when r3 and vishal both realise there’s a phone left at the crime scene and they’re both racing towards it . at that point i was like FUUUCK IDK IF I WANT R3 OR VISHAL TO WIN bro ALLLLL the characters are likeable and from their perspectives they’re ALL RIGHT it’s just SO much fun watching all this unfold . the runtime is PERFECT dude , i wasn’t bored ONCE in the second half . also the story isn’t predictable AT ALL , like you assume that r3 and vishal will meet when they’re searching for the phone but you can never guess HOW or when or where it happens like the movies rly keeps u on ur toes i love it \n\nALSO CI SRINU LOOOOL THE MANAGER FROM ANTE bro he was funny in ante but he is HILAAAARIOUS HERE LMAO i’m laughing just thinking about him bro LOL WHEN HE SEES R3 GO PAST OM THE BIKE n he’s jus like “nah it’s not them” 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 AND THE SOMETHING IS FISHY LMAOAOAOAOAOA NAH I LOVE HIM SO MUCH 😭 but holy character arc wtf?!?!?!?!!? i was NOT expecting him to be the one who acc talks sense into RK cos the entire runtime he’s jus a silly old guy and then SUDDENLY he becomes the voice of wisdom n makes rk loosu punde lock in bro that was SOOOO satisfying , especially cos it’s SO out of the blue like he was jus comic relief the whole time but that was SUUUUUUUCH a great writing choice bro omg \n\nalso the music was beautiful, the SCORE TOO HOLY bro it was used SOOOO well , made all the comedic scenes even funnier and all the like RACY moments feel even more tense . i’m listening to the album rn this is so so hard dude talapu talapu and chalaname 😍😍 listening to this lowkey made the rest of ante album sound even better too if that makes sense \n\nthe rahul mithra romance was super cute and lowkey even tho romance is like my favourite thing in the entire world rn i cared MORE ABOUT R3 bro like their chemistry is INCREEEEEEDIBLE !!! they bounce off each other so well and all have small differences in their personalities that makes them feel like REAL people rather than just characters in a script ygm \n\nthe ending im NGL i looooowkey wish they made it like 5 mins longer cos i felt like it skipped forward a little but regardless i LOOOOVE how they managed to close off EVERY storyline SO well do you know how difficult that is to do bro in such a short runtime asw. seeing rahul give subbu the bag back , rk letting mithra see the dance class , r3 acc giving shalini back their money (i think thats what happened anyway) like its SO well done and like i said SO satisfying , like there was literally NO loose ends \n\nim tryna say something about the first half but i acc don’t remember anything besides r3 cheating in class lmao rewatch pending tho !!!!!! also shalini so so gorgeous holy shit bra \n\nthis feels soooo similar to ante (and crazy stupid love for some reason) , like the seamless switching between different storylines and bringing them all together all whilst being INCREDIBLY funny and charming and EMOTIONAL and intense and like, BRO IDK😭😭😭 . vivek manages to fit so many different feelings in these movies and they NEVER feel forced/preachy (besides that one bit in ante) . they’re fast paced and still fit in emotional scenes without making it drag , and the stories are over the top but have a grounded vibe to them at the same time if that makes sense. like in this movie all the coincidences n stuff are ridiculous but the characters all feel SOOO realistic it meshes together so well , and in ante there’s a lot of ridiculous scenes (like when nani n aparna make a plan for him to go to US) but again all the characters are so charming and fun to watch gosh i love these 2 movies so much . it makes saripodhaa even more disappointing BUTTTTTT that is a completely different genre tbf and it’s defo still enjoyable , but these 2 movies r lowkey in my top 25 movies like ever so he’s set a high standard for himself lol \n\nalso 60 second red light is absolutely INSANE bro wtf ?!?!?!?! no way is that just a thing in india bra with that traffic as well holy shit i’d kms if i had to drive there. central ldn is annoying enough w all those PRICK speed cameras n 20 zones anyway if u read all of this holy shit bra thank u but get a job 😭😭😭😭😭😭SORRY LOL",
