    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "i used to be obsessed w this movie back when it dropped i wanted to call my kid kabilan 😭😭😭😭😭\n\nicl first 20 mins i rly couldn’t be bothered to watch it cos i wasn’t rly in the mood for action drama but BROOOO WHEN THAT FUCKING TITLE TRACK PLAYS 😩😩😩😩😩 bro SaNa’s music is lowkey my fav bit of this movie bro the album is COLD even tho it only has 2 songs . but the SCORE ???? YOOOOOOOO it’s SO good bro i NEED his version of neeye oli to drop NOW !! nah genuinely this score is so hard bro like im in the biggest rut of my life rn but the bgm when he’s training w beedi thaatha or when he wins a fight or during the romance scene bro ALL OF THEM R FUCKING BANGERS y is he not getting tamil movies anymore 💔💔 im glad he’s getting all these massive pan indian projects like kalki n that salman khan one but i MISS HIM BRO I NEED ANOTHER JIGARTHANDA OR IRAIVI ALBUM i was in his top 100 listeners last year bro i need him back 😭😭😭😭😭\n\nanyway colour grading holy shit bro this movie is so so beautiful. haven’t watched a movie on my tv in so long but this lowkey blew my mind bro every scene is GORGEOUS . lowkey the final 30 mins of the movie after he starts training w beedi thaatha is peak cinema in every aspect bro HOOOOLY SHIT YO I JUST REMEMBERED the shot where they reveal his final transformation n he’s standing in the sea and the waves crashing down IS WHAT SHOWS THE NEW KABILA BRO THATS FUCNING CINEMAAAAAAA how do you even THINK of framing a shot like that bro . WTF 😭😭😭😭😭😭 climax fight also so gorgeous \n\nalso i love how every side character is written sooooooo well and all have individual motives and quirks , i was slyly dreading rewatching this cos it’s 3 hours long but it genuinely doesn’t lag that much at all bro (except the political scenes imo they were so dry) . anyway the characters bro my favourite has to be DADDY BRO LOOOOOL HES SO FUNNY ‘bloody bugger’ 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭  i love him man . BRO LMAOO THAT ONE LINE “nee puli illa man, mookla vaara challi” dkm 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 dancing rose too cos he’s the only one in that clan that’s honest and he’s flipping fun to watch too bro ik everyone n their mothers saying this but we need dancing rose spin off !! i could lowkey write a para about every side character bro it’s actually incredible that ranjith gave EVERY character their own arcs , i looooooved raman and vetri’s redemption arcs . especially vetri was so well done bro i love kalayarisan n even tho he did slyly ruin kabilas life , from his pov he’s LOOOOWKEY not that in the wrong like his own father left him in the dust bro paavam. kabila downfall arc was soo good i wanted it to be a little longer ngl also DUSHARA SOOOOO GOOD also slyly hilarious when she kept yelling the baby cos she was crying 😭😭\n\ni’m still very excited for sarpatta 2 (espec cos sana is returning) but icl i haven’t enjoyed any of ranjith’s other movies n i lowkey REALLY disliked thangalaan. i still need to watch attakathi cos banger album n its a romance movie but idk man. everytime im SUPER excited for a movie it always ends up disappointing me a lot (ps1, thangalaan, capt miller) . veera dheera soora is prolly my most anticipated movie rn but yk how vikram is bra guy has the worst script selection of ALL TIME \n\nok im yapping for so long my job starts at 3am now cos of christmas bro i am gonna KILL myself 😭😭 im acc doing too much for £14/hr bro ill jus be poor instead . need to watch another romance movie bro its been sooooooooo long (3 days) also deep my movie streak 9 days in a row yk?!?!?! i need to discover a new 10/10 movie bro it feels so weird only having 3 favourites but lowkey none of my 5 star movies r speaking to me like that does that make sense or am i jus waffling again . i lowkey wanna become a super nerd n start putting like 20 tags on each of my entries bro its so cool seeing ppl who have like 100 tags n they’re all SUPER specific i wanna do that 😭😭😭 but im not organised enough . okay no this is getting ridiculous bye\n\nactually wait lol have u guys ever blocked anyone on here ?!?!? bro there’s this one account n everytime i read her reviews it PISSES me off bro yk those ppl who jus don’t like ANYTHING?? icl i just reread this n my past 5 reviews why do i say bro so many times",
