    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "sooooo cute mild spoilers \n\nngl i had to take a THREE hour break halfway thru cos my dads car got broken into n i had to go help him w insurance 😭😭😭😭\n\nsecond oldest movie ive ever seen also i can’t BELIEVE this was written in 1986 bro it feels sooooo modern . the relationship is sooo complex and i love that it doesn’t try and villainise anyone . it has a lot to say about societal pressures on woman and stuff that im waaaayy too dumb to talk about but again its CRAZY that this movie is over 30 years old n tackles subjects like that bro . that’s one of the reasons y i love kannathil muthamittal asw cos it talks about subjects that barely any other director is brave enough to make movies about \n\nrevathi and mohan were so good bra not to sound like a stupid 2000’s baby but he’s the fucking VILLAIN FROM GOAT LOOOOL WTF but anyway their performances were CRAZY bro especially in the last hour of the movie cos there’s a sense of fear or pride or ego or idk WHAT it is but you can tell these people like each other but there’s something stopping them from wanting to admit that and it’s shown really really well. like that one scene where chandra gives divya the ticket and they hesitate and it shows us their faces , but puts a voiceover bro even without that voiceover you can tell EXACTLY what these guys r thinking . after that scene is where the film peaks imo . i love the way mani ratnam does romance bro i still think my fav movie by him is ok kanmani n then alaipayuthey (need to rewatch that so bad) and in alllll these movies none of the characters are necessarily doing the ‘wrong thing’ which i think is what makes these films so thought provoking \n\nalso karthik bra what a guy even i was falling in love w him for a bit . hope i can become as cool as him one day \n\nsoundtrack is gorgeous bro i didn’t realise that ALLLLL of these songs came from THIS ONE ALBUM????  FAAAACKING HELL icl the score felt a little too melodramatic thats jus me tho . also when they went to the taj mahal why was there that one song w two randoms dons being super intimate bro what was that about 😭😭😭😭\n\nthe movies surprisingly funny asw bro the whole subplot where she taught that hindi guy insults in tamil was so jokes 😭😭😭 \n\nLOL ALSO i’m gonna sound like a MEGA nerd but at the start when divya’s in the classroom they’re learning SIMPLEX METHOD FROM FURTHER MATHS LOL WTF I REMEMBER LEARNING THAT IN Y13 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 bro i UNDERSTOOD EVERYTHING SHE WAS SAYING THAT FELT SO WEIRD",
