    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "yo i’m actually so cooked 😭😭😭😭😭😭 moved back into uni today n for the first time in like 2 months i was feeling a non romantic movie n this genre i would’ve been sooooo in love with in summer , that proper violent cool gangster drama vibe but good gosh 💀💀💀 literally 40 mins in that feeling wore off n i was STRUUUUUGLING to get thru the movie bro i havent even finished it yet 😭 i feel bad cos its SUPER acclaimed but the endless pursuit for comfort continues 🔥🔥🔥🔥 im jus gonna watch like piku or jab we met or something bro \n\nalso mini life update WORST START OF A YEAR EVER 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 \ni had the mega fever n had to cancel like THREE MOTIVES including my OWN BIRTHDAY !!! and then i got a haircut for the first time in like five months today and guys 💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔 the mullet is gone 💔💔💔💔💔💔💔\n\nbro i haven’t had short hair in like 3 years bro who AM I ?!?!? feels SOOO WEIRD I MISS HAVING LOMG HAIR IT WAS MY BEST FEATURE 😭 now i need to go thru the awkward stage again gonna be like 6 7 months before my hairs long again , bro i lost like a YEAR OF PROGRESS 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 \n\nIM NOT EVEN DONE LMAOOOO i moved in today but i fucking FORGOT ALL OF MY HOODIES😭😭 and it’s fucking SNOWING DUDE how often does it snow in the uk n the one time it does i only have T SHIRTS TO FUCKING GO OUT IN LOOOOOL now my mums gonna ship ALL of my hoodies over to me bro wtf 😭😭😭😭 left my backpack at home asw bro how the hell am i gonna bring my stuff to uni it’s like the universe is ASKING me to skip lectures",
