    "isLiked": false,
    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "baaaaaanger \n\none of my reviews got ten likes guys if you have my number please delete it and don’t try message me anywhere i will not reply 🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽 i don’t have time anymore sorry \n\nanyway holy cinematography tho dude the colours are sooooooooo beautiful , lowkey made me regret selling my cam again i started looking thru y13 pics when i would go EVERYWEHRE w my cam it made me bare nostalgic . anyway the movie again sooo stunning it made me nostalgic for a summer i never even had if that makes sense \n\nalso the shot from the pov of the ball 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 and the DOUBLE split diopter if thats even a thing was so insane \n\nthe whole time i thought art was british how is PAT is the british one \n\ni LOOOOVED the non linear part i’ll admit i was slyly confused at the start but in the final 40 ish mins 🤯🤯🤯\n\nok spoilers\n\nbro ALL THE MINI REVEALS IN SECOND HALF WERE SOOOO GOOD cos you keep thinking that art or pat has the upper hand and then BOOM flashback n it flips the dynamic on its head and it just keeps DOING IT AND DOING IT and ngl , going into it i was a little worried cos everyone keeps saying the movie is all ab symbolism n stuff n my attention span is lowkey 💔💔 rn BUT BROO all the mini details make it SOOO much more engaging . like the scene when they’re making out in pat’s car and you see the poster w art in the background, and it’s theweek of the match and then earlier in the movie they showed the night before the match w the poster TORN DOWN N ITS LIKE 🔥🔥🔥🔥 lowkey not smart enough to explain but i rly like how it doesn’t spoon feed u anything. BRO I KNNEEEEEWWWW he was gonna do the ball in the centre of the racket thing THAT WAS SO GOOD . also lowkey most abrupt ending of all time ?!?!?!?!?!?!? icl i slyly felt bad for pat when he caught art and im shocked they didn’t expand on that bit \n\nalsl im so fucking stupid lmao when they’re having that convo in the sauna n they’re like “i haven’t  won but i got the most important points of the match” n i thought i was SOOOOO SMART cos i was like bro they’re not talking ab tennis rn warra symbolism n then LITERALLY THE NEXT LINE PAT SAYS “we’re nkt talking ab tennis rn” LMAOOOO\n\nwhat was up w the whole scratchy arm thing was he on ped’s or something \n\nlowkey that edm score was kinda annoying also why were there SO MANY SEX SCENES 😭😭😭 tbf i am being a big fat baby but i wasn’t expecting there to be THAT many . OH YEAH AND THE SCENE IN THE CHANGING ROOM LOOL WHY WAS EVERYONES COCK N BALLS OUT LMAOOOOO",
