    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "HOLY 💔 BANGER\n\nwatched w niki\n\nbroooo first hour and a half of this movie i was like this is so cute and i was expecting them to like move away from each other or 'break up' or whatever but THAT was the ending !?!?!?!?!?!? WTF 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭\n\nalso holy shit most beautiful gorgeous score ever and the women were so 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍\n\nfirst half was actually so funny , like all these characters are naturally kinda funny so just seeing them go about their day was just entertaining, and ira and preetam had SUCH great chemistry like i was slyyyyyly rooting for them to cheat 😭😭😭 lowkey this movie gave me mega 96 vibes, like the scene when they 'break up' was LITERALLY exactly like 96 but instead of the plane going thru the heart its the train. bro FUCK MAN THAT REVEAL WAS SOOOOOOO FUCKED bro i literally made roti and that ENTIRE scene i jus had a piece of roti n curry SITTING IN MY MOUTH COS I WAS SO IN SHOCK BRO that was SOOOOOOO out of the blue WTF 😭😭\n\nalso i loved that they didn't explicitly show ira's trauma like i feel like way too many indian movies nowadays are jus including scenes like that cos its an easy way to get the audience to feel disgust \n\nthe entire like message of this movie was really sweet bro i really liked it. icl if i was watching on my ones i MIIIIGHT have cried espec at that reveal but hell nah was too scared to cry in front of someone else",
