    "review": "HOOOOOOOLYYYYY BAAAAAAAANGERRRRRR DUDE\n\nicl i went into this film with the highest expectations ever which was a terrible idea , the final 30 mins slyly lost me cos the movie didn’t go exactly how i wanted to 😭😭😭 but BESIDES that this movies SOOOOO GOOD BRO\n\nholy cinematography btw 😍😍😍😍😍😍 colours framing everything so so beautiful bro recently the american dream has come back to life for me , seems like such a fun place to live . anyway the movies super pretty like i wanna rewatch just cos it looks so nice . that grain mmmmm goes with the aesthetic so well . \n\ni was only THREE in 2008 so i didn’t rly live in this period but this still feels SOOOOO relatable n even tho these guys r 13 in the movie it feels relatable to me NOW thats lowkey embarrassing 😭😭😭 but all the characters r written sooooo well man and so believable like it literally feels like we’re just watching a day in the life of a teenager dude its so well done . mySpace seems like the coolest website ever bro they should lowkey bring that back okay this isn’t even gonna be a review of the movie bro this is jus life update again \n\nmild spoilers !!! 🔥🔥🔥ive never felt so represented by a movie like i feel like ive gone through every thing didi went thru in this movie bro DOING WEED FOR THE FIRST (and last) TIME????? SOOOOO SCARY DUDE but if i had a trip like that i think actually would’ve killed myself bro thats TERRIFYING\n\nand the whole shifting friendship group thing bro i still see my old guys around sometimes n i cant stop thinking ab how miserable my life would be if i didn’t find this new group bro they lowkey saved me\n\nand the generational fumble 💔💔💔 \n\nalso the entire mum subplot bro i feel like i used to act that way to my mum and looking back it’s actually the most disgusting thing ever bro like thats my AMMA dude !!! we’re super bredrins now which is great but seeing it in a movie like this rly puts into perspective that ur parents are also living for the first time n have their own struggles n stuff , also the actress was phenomenal . the first hour of the movie is peak comfort film but in a way it becomes PRETTY SAD towards the ending . its a really realistic portrayal of life tho and i think because im kiiiinda in a similar phase of life rn i didnt like how personal the movie was getting 😭😭. bro if they made a sequel to this movie n its focussed on the uni period of life i would EAT THAT UP \n\nlife update lol\n\nicl tho even tho 2025 had the WORST start ever term 2 uni is lowkey going amazing . FINALLY started attending lectures bro im on 100% attendance this term 😛😛😛 compared to 6% IN TERM ONE LMAOOOOO also who would’ve thought going outside makes you SO MUCH HAPPIER? i still don’t have like uni friends (soon come) but im actually talking to new ppl like im fiiiiiiiinally becoming less shy n im gonna try and rise more events now . y does it feel so gay requesting guys on insta LOOOOL . i think im gonna finally try journal for the first time in like TWO FLIPPING MOMTHS BRO okay bye i need to find more movies like this . love u",
