    "review": "BAAAAAAAAANGERRRRR !!!!!!! \n\nhow did i just find out this existed bro nirmal’s levelled up like THAT?????? FAAAACKING HELL \n\nso so so cute bro i was cheesing the whole way through , and its JUST as funny as his youtube videos bro like i laughed out loud at a lot of scenes . also ABHISHEK WAS THERE !!! he was absolutely hilarious but that was expected it was so funny seeing him swear in tamil asw\n\nalso unexpected GORGEOUS cinematography bro WTF ? the way some of these shots were framed is  BEAUTIFUL bro like when they’re in that bookshop n they’re separated by the pile of books , or the entire first house party OR THE RAMEN SHOP SCENE bro everything is lit SO well ! doesn’t look like an amateur project at all i was getting gawx vibes from this . nah this movies actually so gorgeous , i could go on and on about how pretty it is . the grading makes it feel rly comforting in a way \n\nthe chapter title cards ?!?!!? BEAUUUTIFUL bro i just saw all the promo posts and they’re all stunning too that one pic of them inside the tent is so nice bro . like even that mini sequence where she buys the ice cream on her birthday and there’s a gap in the title where there’s supposed to be an E and SHE fills in that gap (i explained that so badly) like EVERYTHING is so nice to look at \n\nalso ishita holy gosh 😍😍😍😍😍😍 icl both their dialogue delivery was a little meady at times but u can excuse it \n\nstory was great too , lowkey was getting la la\nland vibes from it 😭😭😭 the uncle who was interviewing them was so funny too . eren yeager mentioned ! the story felt super relatable too like i defo think this wouldn’t work outside of this age group , that’s y i loved the uncle character so much lmao cos he makes you realise how silly the whole situation is but at the same time i completely sympathise w nirmal n ishita too cos ive BEEN both of them before 😭 \n\nlove this movie \n\ni wanna put literally me tag but im not as funny as nirmal 😭😭also youtube compression is death bro",
