    "review": "this is the most heartbreaking review i’ve ever had to write bro everyone who knows me knows how much cats mean to me 😭 once i saw a cat shelter post a vid of cats that didn’t get adopted for a long time and it made me start BAWLING bro why am i SO EMPATHETIC TO CATS LMAO \n\nthis movie is SOOOOO cute tho , everytime the cat did something that reminded me of my kitties i started cheesing so hard \n\nsound design was so good too , bro sometimes i felt like muting the movie cos the cats cries made me SOOOOOO SAD \n\ncapybara was soo cute too also this might’ve been the first time in my entire life that ive cared ab a dog (but his bredrins were soooooo jarring) \n\nunfortunately tiktok brain has ruined me it felt a little boring at times n by the end i wasn’t even paying attention to it . i think amma would love this movie tho can’t wait to show her when im back in ldn",
