    "review": "yuhhhhh banger !  \n\nmild spoilers \n\nngl bro i wasn’t even gonna watch this movie until i saw it got like top 5 romance of the year or something n even tho it wasn’t the main focus of the movie the romance here was SOOOO GOOD \n\nibr the first 40 mins i wasn’t even paying attention like that but GOOOOOOSH they wrote gethu’s character SOOO WELL BRO also its great seeing him in act in not the most serious movie of all time 😭 like they fucked his eyes over permenantly in cuckoo then ABUSED him in visarnai bro GIVE HIM A BREAK 😭😭😭 anyway gethu n anbu were both rly good characters like the entire second half i was just BEGGING these man to communicate to EACH OTHER like PUT UR PRIDE ASIDE FOR ONCE PLEAAAASEEEE !!! \n\nanyway let me acc jus talk ab the romance , bro i absolutely adored both the couples in this film . also the female characters !!! so good bro anyway both couples were so cute and i was completely emotionally invested in them bro when gethu slept on her saree 💔💔 so cute da . i really like how the women are kinda the pillars of stability in the men’s lives . nah man all the relationships were really well written but maybe it’s jus me but the way gethu’s family would talk to each other lowkey made me bug out 😭😭😭 like calling ur own AMMA nee and di is CRAAAAZY\n\nalso anbu’s friend was flipping HILARIOUS bro i wasnt expecting this movie to be THIS FUNNY LOL i was acc laughing out loud BARE times . icl i was reading the reviews n everyone was bare glazing harish kalyan , n the rumours r true he’s acc super duper lengers 😍 normally id be glazing the actresses in this review but aadeeeennngaaappppa harish kutty IM GAAJI FOR U 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 (i promise im straight i litr love boobs so much) also that team name is SO FUNNY LOL ADENGAPPA PATHINORUU PEERRUUUUUU!!!! \n\nalso i LOOOOVED that the movie tackled serious topics in a easily digestible and NOT CORNY way like the female representation was sm better than in bigil 😭😭😭 n the caste stuff ibr idk anything about it but all the stuff w kaali venkat’s character n the ending it was so sweet n a great message too . i acc rly liked the ending espec the reference w the anbu t shirt 🤭🤭\n\nicl i wanted to do a mega life update but im way too lazy 😭\ni kinda wanna watch la la land again is that insane yes or no",
