    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔 \n\nMANNNNNNNN i wanted to love this movie so bad bro \n\nwatched cos this is one of sohaib’s fav movies he tried to tell me this was better than yeh jawaani 😂😂😂😂😂😂 \n\nsuper pretty movie but besides that the movie didn’t click with me AT ALL that’s acc so sad \n\ni didn’t even finish the movie bra maybe i need to rewatch \n\nlife update !!!\n\nbro im finally in my journalling bag again ive started journalling PHYSICALLY asw i got this little notebook n i wrote EIGHT pages in it today bro this might be the most ive written since econ a level 😭😭😭😭 i keep seeing these tiktoks of people making like ‘mixed media’ journals n sticking random stuff into it like receipts and photos and tickets and stuff n i wanna do that soooo bad bro. icl im lowkey really grateful for this app cos when i gave up on journalling i had to read thru my old reviews to see how i was feeling at the time ANYWAY\n\ni am finally SOCIALISING BRO I FUMBLED TERM 1 SOOOO BAD the tamil society had this event n ibr i really really REALLY didn’t wanna go , i was bare scared cos everyone there is prolly already friends , but new year new me innit i cant make all the same mistakes from last year again bra . so i bought some alc before i went (first time buying it myself i felt like such a bad son) n FAAAAACK man IT MADE ME SOOOO much less anxious man i was in that event talking to EEEEEEVERYBODY !!! ngl half the guys in the tsoc are lowkey freshies was so annoying but eventually i found these 2 guys who were exactly like my ldn friends , not to be gay but im so glad i found them . went to this drake x desi club event n i saw 300 of the most gorgeous women of all time bro holy SHIT 😍😍 didn’t speak to any of them tho the alc wore off #ImAPussy . maybe im jus a super virgin but i acc don’t know how guys can make out with randoms at the club bro like if i haven’t been in love with u for at least 3 months whats the point 💔💔 then i walked back to my accom from campus bro its a 40 min walk where did i get that energy from at 3am 😭😭😭 ngl as boring as cov is u could never walk outside on ur ones in south ldn bro i cant wait to leave england when im older\n\none of the guys i spoke to is president of gaana soc n i lowkey wanna get in my dancing bag again 😛😛 im not GOOD but new year new me innit it’s socialisation n that okay im lowkey yapping now \n\nsong of the week is rare by len holy banger dude",
