    "review": "SOOOOOO CUTEEEEE\n\nbro all of these stories were sooo nice and ngl might be an unpopular opinion but the first was lowkey my least fav 😭 \n\nACTUALLY NAH LOL bro WTF was the second story 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 bro i remember seeing this clip on insta where manikandan was jus listing bare random porn stars BRO WHAT THE HELLLLLL thats half the reason i even watched this movie that was so weird 😭😭 that entire storyline was kinda weird but at the same time it was kinda cute ! also SARAHAH LOL I HAVENT HEARD THAT NAME IN YEAAAAAAAARSSSS that and tellonym what a throwback dude \n\nalso music bro pradeep kumar did ALL THE MUSIC???? NO WONDER THE SCORE WAS SO NICE BRO OMGGGG\n\nthird story as well was soooo wholesome bro like they lowkey had so much chemistry and why did thatha lowkey have SO MUCH RIZZ???? guy was getting ACTIIIIIIIIVE ! like the way he asked to kiss her that was CRAAAAZY BRO IT WOULDVE WORKED ON ME ! wouldve been my fav story if it wasnt for the last one\n\nOK SUNAINA STORY OMGGGGGGGGG the other half of the reason why i wanted to watch this movie was cos shes SOOOOOOO GORGEOUS but lowkey why does samuthirakani look WAY older thjan her fam 😭 like i thought he was supposed to be her dad or something at the start they do have aFIFTEEN year gap irl tbf thats nuts . bro vikrams new movie dushara is the same age as his son n shes playing his love interest thats FUUUCKED 😭😭😭 anyway i was lowkey cheesing thru this entire storyline bro their family dynamic was sooooo adorable bro i cant WAIT to get married n have my own kids !!!!!!! seems like the most fun thing ever fam . anyway i think they could've made this last story into its own movie like i really liked their vibe, when  they finally start getting lovey dovey to each other 🤗🤭🤭🤭🤭🤭🤭",
