    "review": "no flipping way am i watching la la land again already 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭\n\nit’s actually impossible to describe how much this movie means to me bro \n\nalso i’ve put three people onto this movie so far and all of them cried yk that’s like top 5 things im most proud of in my entire life \n\ni LOVE how many long takes there are bro how is another day of sun and lovely night BOTH DONE IN ONE TAKE THATS SO CRAZY\n\ni always say in my reviews that i like when movies get a bit fantastical and really show what a character is feeling and the planetarium scene does this SOOOO well \n\ni’ve said it a billion times but this soundtrack and score is actually phenomenal man . and the grading bro SOLELY because of this movie i’ve been DREAMING of visiting LA one day and renting a car and just exploring the ends like it looks like SUCH a gorgeous city dude. imagine tryna make london look like that ????? hell nah 😭😭😭 summer 2026 im ACTIVE THO MANDEM HOLIDAY TO AMERICA LETS FUCKING GOOOO !!! \n\nanyway i’ve said so much about this movie that i literally can’t write any more so\n\nlife update time ! icl this past weekend was one of the more difficult ones ive had in ages like i was jus having bare anxiety and i really needed something to escape in and nothing does it better than la la land man . like i engross myself in that world so easily and genuinely forget everything else thats going on im so glad i found this movie . bro lowkey if my future chellakutty doesn’t like this film thats gonna be BARE controversial cos wdym you don’t wanna do a day trip and see all the locations from the movie ?!?!?!? also im so jealous of these guys’ chemistry bro not even the relationship aspect of it but one thing thats been in my mind a lot lately is the fact that i dont really have my own best friend, like i have a few best friends but i sly feel like they have other friends that they prefer over me n sure its selfish of me to think like that but likkeeeeee. not to get bare philosophical but i think i jus dont love myself enough which is where a lot of my issues stem from but ive been trying to change that ! like im always yearning to be something im not if that makes any sense . lowkey when i went to go visit my cousins over the weekend even tho mentally i was COOKED i also felt like a kid again in a way . i see these guys so rarely but i have soooo many memories w them and icl if i was stuck at home that weeknd instead ?!?!? yh long id be FUCKED ! where’s my soulmate at brav this is bare annoying . i’ve said it loads of times but the american dream has rly revived for me n im INCREDIBLY jealous of my us boxd friends u man look like u have the most fun lives ever bro england is FUCKING BORING 😭😭😭 US UNIS ARE SO BIG AND COOL BRO I HATE IT HERE !!!! lowkey i wanna apply to do a year abroad and study in canada or us \n\nalso today i learned how to cook fried rice and holy FUCKING GOSH WHEN DID I BECOME A CHEF BLAAAAAD THAT WAS ONE OF THE BEST MEALS IVE EVER MADEEEEEE !!! i remember first couple weeks of uni my shopping baskets were jus pepsi max yazoo pot noodles and air fryer chicken bro ive FUCKING LEVELLED UP MAN , went shops today n bought spring onions n soy sauce n a chopping board like i jus went n bought a bunch of ingredients and i cooked eggs for the first time in my life lmaoooo my entire life ive hated them but im actually not a baby anymore dude . also i started drinking chia seed water who do i actually think i am 😭😭😭😭😭guys acting like a health guru looool . anyway that feeling of learning something new (and doing it WELL TOO) just felt really nice man ive been trying to get out of my BUM era lately cos ive lowkey been a lazy fat shit recently . today was one of my most productive days in ages tho i deep cleaned my room asw n did a bunch of stuff from my to do list thats been waiting there for WEEKS bro . feels so rewarding . icl i didn’t do any uni work tho n my attendance is sly dropping again but mentally im doing amazing today dude like im so happy rn . normally my life updates are bare depressing loool this is a nice change of pace \n\nsong of the week is un peru enna by teejay \nbut also lowkey kandangi ratty’s remix what a banger dude\nbut also lowkey thamburati IFT remix \nidk ive been in my tamil independent music bag lately",
