    "review": "everytime i watch this movie i get this deep feeling that i need to change myself cos i see a lot of myself in tom (which is NOT A GOOD THING !!!) the first time i watched this i was fresh off a break up and this movie BROOOKE ME LOOOL\n\nme n soha always talk about this movie cos im more like tom and he’s more like summer and idk i jus find it interesting cos we’re similar in so ways but this ONE MOVIE we’re completely opposite ppl \n\nngl i only watched this today cos ive been watching new girl w niki and its SOOOOO GOOD DUDE SUPER COMFORT SHOW WTF !! but cos niki is a PRICK i can’t watch it without her 💔💔 zoey is so good dude i love her\n\nalso the movies actually stunning asw like these colours 😍😍😍 good gosh \n\nim in love w the ending too , the first time i watched it i thought it was a good ending cos hes finally found his ‘soulmate’ , but the second time i realised hes lowkey just entering the same cycle he was in with summer . but now im realising tom’s grown so much since summer , and i think that scene where they show him being rejected by all the architecture firms, or even DURING his interaction w autumn where he asks her on a date n she says she’s busy, his reaction is much more composed than he ever was w summer n i think that’s supposed to show that he has a much more realistic mindset than before . that’s gonna be me soon come\n\nanyway not to get bare personal but a lot of tom’s traits like idealising ppl and a lack of passion and being a ‘hopeless romantic’ like all those LOSER characteristics lowkey resonate w me a bit rn it’s so embarrassing 😭😭😭 tom (and me) feels like he’ll find what he needs to complete himself in another person which is SUUUPER unhealthy ! i’ve always thought that romantic relationships were the most important thing in my life but lately ive been tryna move away from that idea . i loveeee the little locking in montage tom has when he starts to forget ab summer n relationships n all that n that’s the phase of life im tryna be in . ive been working towards it by learning to cook and guitar and acc socialising and being a NORMAL person but idk it feels like im lowkey playing a character and pretending to be someone im not does that make any sense 😭😭😭idk i love and hate how relatable this movie is its a real slap in the face seeing how much of a PUSSIO tom is in this movie \n\nlowkey this is the most loser review i’ve ever posted i am NEVER journalling on this app ever again 😭❌❌",
