    "review": "HOOOOOOLY THROWBACK !!! \n\ndidn’t know niki was the nack to my nick 😛😛😛\n\nbro i don’t think ive ever felt so much nostalgia watching a movie EVER BEFORE IN MY ENTIRE LIFE this reminds me of when we used to have the little tv screen things in the back of appas car n we put cd’s on it n watched random movies on it bro my SISTER put me onto this why is it LOWKEY a banger !!!\n\ni was genuinely smiling the entire way thru lol so cutie putie movie why were serafina n wolfie lowkey the cutest couple here \n\nalso annalise n erika goodness gracious 😍😍😍😍😍😍\n\nwhy are the songs lowkey actually good bro , how could i refuse and ESPECIALLY YOURE JUST LIKE ME??? BAAAAAAANNNGGEEERRRRR\n\neven the graphics felt bare nostalgic bro i was getting\nmega xbox 360 vibes , i used to have this one kung fu panda game on the 360 back when we had that little shit FAT BOX tv in like 2010 n this movie reminded me of that a lot bro why have i been indulging in nostalgia SO MUCH LATELY LOL WTF\n\nthis movies only a couple months older than me bro i might be #unc wtf 💔 bro this movie looks SO OUT OF PLACE IN MY DIARY LMAO WTF \n\nbro the last 2 3 months i’ve been complaining that i don’t have enough light hearted funny movies to watch bro THIS IS EXACTLY WHAT I NEEDED LOL I JUST NEEDED TO WATCH DISNEY MOVIES DUDE 😭😭 also i kept laughing at all the slapstick humour im such a baby \n\ni know i said song of the week like 2 days ago but the NEW song of the week is neeya pesiyathu i LOVE that song \n\ni wanna watch conjuring but my best friend is a loosu bhayanthaankoli 💔",
