    "review": "BAAANGER !!!\n\ni’ve never been in a toxic relationship but i’ve defo felt some of the toxic feelings arun showed in this movie unfortunately lol \n\ni think it’s easy to get annoyed at both the characters in this story and even tho i could sly relate to arun he was starting to PISS me off near the ending bro GET A GRIP !!! at the same time tho six years ?? go get your wife back omg 😭 it took me like 3 years to move on from a 7 month SITUATIONSHIP NOT EVEN RELATIONSHIP LMAO bro six years i think i would’ve jus killed myself or became a terrorist that’s acc insane ! sorry im going off track but from the outside looking in its so easy to say these guys are being bare stupid but i think the movie does a good job of showing how hard it is to put emotions to the side in a situation like that , LOL all the scenes where arun’s doing something n he gets a flashback to when he did that w divya bro that shit can RUIN YOUR ENTIRE DAY LMAOOOOO i don’t miss that at all 😭😭😭\n\nI LOOOOOVE that they included manikandan’s mimicry in the movie that vjs voice is ridiiiicuulous \n\nalso the album and the score are both beautiful , thaensundare, ezhutha kadhaiyo and apple crumble are all BANGERS ! it was so cute finding out why apple crumble was called that \n\nthe visuals ?!?!!? good gosh bro i loved allll the scenes at the beach all those wide shots , all the scenes in the corner of arun’s room , bro ALL THE SCENES were so pretty the lighting department did their ting here man its so beautiful \n\nmild spoiler ! \n\ni like how they hinted at the effect ur upbringing n parents can have on ur behaviours , i feel like a lot of the insecurities n fears i have stem from the rocky relationship my parents had when i was younger . arun is still super toxic n there’s no denying that but i couldn’t help but feel bad for him when they explored his family situation a bit more , the scene where they saw his dad walking around w another woman almost made me start breaking down bro this movie hit a little too close to home \n\ni think if i write any more im acc gonna start crying bro i clocked i actually sound like a wasteman in these reviews LMAOOOOO YO I PROMISE IM COOL THIS IS JUST A PHASE 😭😭😭\n\nok proper spoilers nowoh yeah wait the ending tho . loved it so much man from the moment divya compared him to his father u can tell it changed something in arun n made him kinda look at himself in the third person . i saw this one tweet that was like ur one crash out away from ur hardest lock in ever n this movies the DEFINITION of it bro i was sooo happy at the ending cos you can VISIBLY see how much better arun’s doing. no more knacks scooter asw he has a BAD boy motor now !!! i think they could’ve ended the movie before the time jump but i like that they gave him a redemption arc, cos i really do think arun was a good guy who had too many bad influences around him (his father n deepak), n showing how much he’s changed after cutting those out of his life was a good way to show that he genuinely could be a good person . i’m glad they left the ending open tho \n\nalso i really liked when madan opened up ab the real reason he broke up w his girl cos again it showed potential for arun to change , cos even madan was somewhat similar to him but managed to become a massive green flag . the entire movie i was waiting for them to have more interactions together and the car ride back home made me so happy , especially when u compare the humility arun had to accept madan’s help w the cafe stuff to when they went to the party at the start n he banged that guy for offering to help him find investors (icl he was suuuuper jarring tho)\n\ngot a 9am tmrw im gonna kill myself\n\nsong of the day is piriyadhey from sita ramam\n\nwait im back a day later i was so emotional i can’t believe i forgot to mention how STUNNING divya and ramya were bro goodness GRACIOUS 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍",
