    "review": "today was so fun dude george has been tryna get the guys to do a hp marathon for a couple weeks now n fiiiiiinally we started (marathon lasted exactly 1 movie 🔥🔥🔥) \n\nwe ordered dominos and ben n jerrys n booked the CINEMA room in our accom bro TONIGHT WAS SO SWEET LOL the whole thing was jus a surprise cos one of our friends was bare sad i love these guys sm \n\ni cant believe im a 20 year old BRITISH boy n haven’t seen this series yet besides that one time they made us watch it in primary school for some reason lmao \n\nanyway i was sly expecting to hate it but it was acc rly good, also its INSANE that all the leads were ELEVEN DURING THIS MOVIE WTFFF all the scenes where hagrid was standing next to them were so adorable they’re so kutty !!! george kept telling me i might cry at deathly hallows pt.2 bro if hagrid dies im gonna kill EVERYONE he’s so cute \n\nit was lowkey a really cute movie I LOVE ALL THE CATS LOL but the main trio is so sweet dude i need a ron weasley in my life fr . everyone kept saying you’ll find ur forever friends at uni man where ARE THEY ?!?!? \n\nok i need to talk about the elephant in the room i fucking FELL ASLEEP AGAIN LMAOOOOO BRO I DONT KMOW WHY I SLEPT IN PRISONER OF AZKABAN TOO WHATS WRONG WITH ME 😭😭 this time at least i was fully locked in until the last 20 mins where i just CONKED LMAO bro they were talking ab the movie afterwards n some of the characters these man were mentioning i didnt even remember HEARIG THEIR NAMES BRO WTF 😭\n\ni did one of those personality test things n i got hufflepuff thats lowkey so accurate \nnvm i did the pottermore one and got ravenclaw \n\nok this might be the worst review of all time i promise chamber of secrets review will ACTUALLY be about the movie 😭😭😭😭😭 sorry gang",
