    "review": "BANGER !!!!! \n\nthis and before sunrise have single handedly removed ALL progress towards being okay w being single i need a girlfriend NOW !!! \n\nbro this movies SOOOOO FUNNY WTF the ENTIRE first half i was jus GIGGLING bro mani n especially ramesh thilak are like comfort actors for me if that makes sense, every time i see them i jus start smiling loool not in a gay way\n\ntheir chemistry was SOOO good bro WAIT LMAOOOO ALL THE LITTLE ONE LINERS AND THE SLIDING JOKE bro when he was crossing the road n was like “im not gonna slide don’t judge me” 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 that and the “dog bites new slippers” FUCK OFFFF LMAOOOOO\n\nanyway their chemistry bro they were BARE cute ESPECIALLY their banter together like the convo when he was like why do u always address me formally bro i started BLUSHING LOL I LOVE THEM SM MAN\n\ni alr feel like rewatching this and lover bro both bangers and THE ALBUMS TOO????? SEAN ROLDAN UR SOOOO GOATED also i really like how both the movies are polar opposites of each other everything down to how nice his family and friends are, how much of a green flag mani is, and how cute their relationship is\n\nbesides the comedy my fav thing ab the movie was the emotional vulnerability mani had, i like that they showed him crying and they were bare normal ab it and all his boys and family were bare supportive of it and not like “why u  crying ur a man” all that yk . ive only cried in front of ONE of my boys before in my entire life and that was ON CALL bro not even irl that’s CRAZY \n\nthe emotional scenes lowk got ruined for me cos i was on call w my friend n she kept making me LAUGH during the sad scenes but 😭😭😭\n\neven the dog was kinda cute bro i watched another barbie movie n it had dogs in it too bro why are movies tryna make me like dogs\n\nlowkey this review was supposed to be way longer but i sly forgot half of it and ive WATHCHED 2 MOVIES SINCE THEN TOO N NEED TO LOG THEM TOO sorry guys bye love u\n\nwhen i went portugal w the guys euan told me i snored on like the 3rd night and that genuinely ruined my sleep for the rest of the holiday what a stupid fat boy\n\nalso why do they keep CENSORING THESE FLIPPING MOVIES bro EVERY swear word in lover and this got muted thats so jarring",
