    "review": "literally why did i watch this 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭\n\nicl not as good as princess and the pauper but maybe that was jus nostalgia cos LOOOOWKEEEY WHY WAS THE VILLAIN ACC SCARY???? bro i loved that they made her actually like dangerous cos in pauper he was funny but like you KNEW he was useless but HERE??????? ICL FAMMMMMM I THOUGHT SHE WAS GONNA WIN FOR A SEC\n\nthe dragon guy was so funny tho lol\n\nmusic too holy banger ?!?!?!?!?!?!?! even the SCORE WAS GOOD BRO LIKE WHEN SLIDER FIRST APPEARS THAT TENSION SCORE YOOOOOOO and obviously CONNECETEDDDDD PROTECTEDDDDD BANGER BANGER BANGERRRR not as good as im just a girl like u tho thats REAL music \n\ndogs were cute but the kitties in pauper were better 😛 WAIT BUT THR DOGS DANCING WAS SO FUCKING FUNNY LOOOOOL \n\nthe british twins were SO funny but i miss nick n nack 💔💔\n\neverytime i watch these movies i feel like a kid again dude i sent my sister a pic of the movie n she showed my mum n called me silly lmao i hate her !! i love that they reuse models and voice actors niki said it’s supposed to be like barbie acting in each of these stories that’s actually so cute dude \n\n12 dancing princesses is the highest rated so i guess that’s next in the list 😭😭\n\nwas lowkey having a super meady day today this ended the day on a good note 😁 ok gn guys love u \n\nspoilers !oh yeah THE PLOT TWISTS???????? FAAAAIIIIIIIIRSSSSSSSSSSS like when they went to that random mansion in the middle of the forest and the guy was bare glazing n saying they were destined to own this yard AND FOR A SECOND THEY SHOWED HIS GREEN EYES YOOOOOO or when they pretended they were hypnotised then swiped her flute 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥",
