    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "i feel like i probably shouldn’t have watched this movie \n\nespecially not on valentine’s day 😭\n\njust to get it out the way i love how beautiful the movie is , that natural bloom is goooorgeous \n\never since i saw madhu’s comment that the first movie was based on a real story i looked more into it and icl it made this movie 300x more heartbreaking , poor guy man \n\nthe 96 vibes were EVEN stronger this time round , yk just a overwhelming feeling of yearning and longing throughout the ENTIIIIIRE runtime bro this movie was bare sad wtf 😭 i think i prefer how ‘dramatised’ 96 was tho , this is defo a more realistic n mature take but im still an emotional stupid baby so i love the tragedy in 96 . also 96’s score could genuinely be top 10 film scores of all time cos if a few of these scenes had 96’s climax bgm i think i would’ve been BAWLING lmao \n\nalso KITTYYYYY 😍 bro the cat was so cute everytine my mum calls me she shows vaanu ma and aruny i miss them sm 💔 i loved that scene when they were walking up the stairs in silence cos of that awkwardness/tension between them but i could NOT stop thinking ab the cat loool my kitties would NEVER let me hold them for that long 😭😭😭😭😭i wonder if they had to retake that scene cos the cat kept bugging \n\nalso the BODY LANGUAGE ??? bro they kept holding onto each other n letting go after a little bit come ONNNN MANNNNN 💔💔💔 \n\nspoilers !i saw a lot more of myself in jesse n celine this time round, especially in the convo they had on the boat where she was talking about moving on and never fully recovering , n again in the car ride home where they both talk ab how much less romantic they’ve become since their initial encounter . ngl ive been tryna explain the things this movie made me feel the past 15 mins i have gotten NOWHERE 😭😭😭 \n\ni wanted this review to be way longer cos this movie had me thinking ab life a loooooooot but i honestly can’t put my feelings into words . need to rewatch it i think icl i alr rewatched the last 30 mins cos i was kinda distracted the first time 😭\n\nending was FUCKED that was so abrupt . before midnight lowkey has meady reviews im kinda scared 😛\n\nlife update went to the gaana soc dance class yesterday cos lowkey i was having a horror day 😭 but it was so fun man none of the ppl i know well were there so i had to try chat to new ppl AGAIN (my worst fear) but i kept seeing ppl that i met at events before n we clicked man idk y my social anxiety was so bad term 1 . also i FINALLYYYY recorded a vid w one of the groups all the other times i was WAY too scared bro even this time the people i was with had to keep convincing me but im SOOO glad i did it bro was bare proud of myself . icl i watched the video back i was ACTUALLY ASS 😭😭😭😭😭😭 but i felt like i overcame my fear so what eva\n\nalso this new drake pnd album ???!?? good gosh 😖😖😖 songs of the week are deeper and somebody loves me",
