    "review": "lowk this review is ass it’s kinda jus a summary of the movie but what eva 🔥🔥🔥\n\nfinally i have managed to watch a harry potter movie in one sitting WITHOUT FALLING ASLEEP !! icl u man prepare for a MEGA REVIEW COS THIS MOVIE HAS CONVERTED ME !!!!! IM A HP FAN NOW FAM AVADA KADABRA POOOOSIIIIII\n\nbruv i woke up at SIX AM today to watch the movie w niki and this PUNAANEES WIFI CUT OUT HALFWAY WTF 😭😭😭and then like 12 hours later we started the ENTIRE film again so i lowk thought the universe jus didn’t want me to watch this movie this is the FOURTH TIME IVE TRIED TO WATCH THE MOVIE WITHOUT INTERRUPTIONS LMAOOO\n\nive seen the first 30 mins FIVE times now but bro i did NOT realise how much of the movie i missed out when i fell asleep in cinema cos icl besides the train dementor and time travel scene i didnt remember ANYTHING LMAOOO\n\nok time for acc reviewthe series acc locked in so hard w this movie cos the first two were like silly kinda childish i mean it was COOL yeah but i was like there’s no way im watching 8 movies of this lol but BRO?!?!?!?? FAAAACKING HELL ! there’s a massive tonal shift w this movie , i was getting horror movie vibes n it rly hooked me man the scene where the dementors come on the train (or rly any scene w dementors, they’re SO fucking cool man) is my fav scene out of all the movies so far . bro THE COLOUR PALETTE OF THIS MOVIE??? CRAAAAAAZY no more of the oversaturated vibrant tones of the first 2 movies bro . the lighting’s actually riddikulus (get it 😂😂😂) , i love how much more dramatic the contrast is this time \n\nALSO THE POV SHOTS WERE SOOO COOL my fav was when he snuck into hogsmeadge or wtvr it was called n it was the pov of him under the invisibility cloak the whole way fam THATS ANXIETY INDUCING ! and the scenes where the dementors gave harry BLOWS were so cool when it would kinda fade out into black n there’s that reaaallyyy faint woman’s scream in the bg i loved it man . fam the dementors were acc jus aura farming the entire movie bro FREEZING EVERYTHING AROUND THEM , DRESSED IN ALL BLACK THEYRE SOOOOO COOOL FAM\n\nand the transitions???? good gosh 🤤🤤 all the camera moves thru the glass n ESPECIALLY during the riddikulus scene where the cam kept going THRU the mirror bro HOW DID THEY DO THAT 😭😭 also the riddikulus sequence in general was rly entertaining i lowk wish they let a couple people go before harry 😭 i kinda wanted to see what hermione n draco’s biggest fears were\n\nyh fuck this man idk how to talk ab the technical side of movies im lowk bare stupid but anyway bro the STORU LINE WTFFFFF 😭😭\n\ndespite the darker theme the movies lowkey so funny asw i like how much more real the characters feel this time , there were loads of scenes that didnt rly add to the plot but were SOOOO good for making me more invested in the characters like when ron had the nightmares ab spiders n harry was like “yeah you tell them that ron” whys bro lowkey so sassy 😭 or the scene where they eat the magic beans n make animal noises idk i like how cutie putie all the friendships were\n\nhagrids been my fav character ever since the first movie hes so silly n i LOVE how they made him kinda vulnerable here , like when he said “how’s my first day of teaching” or when he was like “they’ve sentenced buckbeak to death!” i was like damn hagrid ur kinda paavam da 💔💔\n\nalso lupin man 🤯 i thought he was so goated the entire movie being bare nice to harry n opening up to him ab his parents like he was slyly a father figure it was rly sweet . imagine the look on my face when he turned out to be BOYS with SIRIUS?!?!? WOMMAAAALAAAAA \nalso i really like how he’s our biggest real look into harrys past like im really really interested in the story of harry’s parents now \nspeaking of sirius bro GARY OLDMAN???? YOOOOO WYS BRO anyway i loved his character arc cos when lupin hugged him i acc thought harry was ab to get SHAFTED but then they explained his backstory n i was like 💔 when he offered to let harry live w him asw that was so nice man . N HE GOT HIM THAT SUPER BROOM FAM YOOOO \nalso bro niki lowk sorry di cos i was kinda yapping the entire movie BUTTT after the sirius reveal ??? yeah FUCKED fam i was litr silent the entire rest of the movie bro they locked in SO HARD\n\npeter pettingrew pussio fam \n\nBUCKBEAKKK !!!! not beakback 😭😭 he was so cutie putie asw bro i hope he comes back in the later films . bruv when he saved harry n hermione at the end i lowkey almost screamed i love him\n\nspeaking of the time travel scene bruv WHAT THE FUUUUUUCK bro that shot where they’re standing still whilst times going backwards BARE COOL and when they were going thru all the previous places in the movie i loved that sm too . the foreshadowing thru out the movie ass man coooolddddd !! like hermione appearing in all the classes out of nowhere , or the random rocks being thrown at hagrids yard \n\ndumbledore was so cool too i kinda prefer og actor (rn anyway) but when he tells hermione to do the time travelling thing idk he was just bare cool i couldn’t help but smile\n\nand obviously the patronas scenes . goodness gracious gosh man that’s PEAAAKKK CINEMAAAA !!! like he thought it was his DAD doing the super expecto patronum but NO ITS HIMSELF FROM THE PAST BRUV THATS REALLLLL WRITING WHAT THE FUCK FAMMMM !!! \nnot to glaze the dementors again but the way u could tell they were arriving w the lake freezing over that was so 🔥🔥🔥\n\ni rly hope the horror themes are here to stay man icl i acc got jumpscared when miss trelawny was saying that prophecy thing ! but alfonso only directed one movie that’s acc biggest fumble ever . i love his cinematography \n\ni cant even call any of the actors leng cos they’re all kids but that DIDNT STOP NIKI LMFAOOOO BRO SHE CALLED DRACO LENG LIKE 83 TIMES DURING THE MOVIE HES OMLY 16!!!!!!! PEEEEEDOOOOOO\n\nalso im watching it again w george n them man im gonna go fucking INSANE if i have to watch the first 20 mins again 😛😛😛😛😛😛😛😛",
