    "review": "SIRIUSSSSS 💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔 bro gary oldman is my fav actor out of the entire cast WE WERE JUS GETTING TO KNOW HIM N THEY M’D HIM OFF ALR WTFFFF😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭i lowk wanna watch the dark knight again jus for him! i said the same thing ab cedric but i love and hate how anticlimactic they make the death scenes. like it’s jus avada kedavra n move on bro LIKE GIVE US TIME WTF 😭 genuinely for a second i thought sirius used a shield or something but no 💔 avlo thaan katha mudinchudu bro FAAACK !!! harry’s reaction was SUPER well shot tho might be my fav scene in the film , muting his screams n the score n letting his body language do all the talking was suchhhh a good choice !\n\nlet me get the negatives out the way first \n\nidk what it is about poa but every movie i’ve seen since then feels like it’s ‘missing’ something that azkaban had does that make sense \nalso is it jus me or was the cg lowkey kinda ass ??? 😭 like the green screen felt kinda obvious and don’t even get me started on grawpy loool that was so bad \nalso visually the movie just didn’t look as interesting as the last 2 imo \n\nBUT AAAANYYYWAYYYYY \n\nim liking the subtle political themes in this movie a lot tho, idk how to explain it but it feels like everything jus became far more complex in this story cos there’s this whole idea of the government covering up the truth and spreading propaganda and all that feels weirdly realistic in this fantasy film lmao \n\nthe score 😍😍 might be the best one yet \n\nvoldemort slowly becoming one of my fav characters now that he’s getting a lot of screen time bro idk what i was expecting but when i looked up his actor n saw it was jus a regular guy i was kinda shocked 😭😭😭 like obviously the actor wasn’t gonna really look like an alien BUT THATS SO WEIRD LMAO THE MAKEUP IS SOOO GOOD i don’t even wanna look up hagrid’s actor not tryna ruin the magic\nbut yeah anyway voldemort ?????? sooo cool man something about the way he talks and moves n the way he grips his wand ?? not really holding it but jus letting it rest in his palm n his long skinny fingers idk bro i loooove his design ! the way he comes into frame after harry uses crucio on bellatrix 😍😍😍 ALSO HARRY USING CRUCIO WTFFFF I DIDNT EVEN HAVE TIME TO DEEP IT COS I WAS SHOCKED BY SIRIUS’ DEATH BUT YOOOOOO 😭 not to be gaaji but bellatrix n petunia lowk lengers in this movie #sorrynotsorry\n\ni looove how these movies lock in so hard in the final 40 mins bro the final act of this movie MIIIIGHT be the best so far besides azkabans time travel sequence \n\nit was so cool how they brought everything together like all the lessons harry was teaching to the other students finally being shown in the department of mysteries and neville FINALLYYY STANDING OM BUSINESS BRO I WAS SO HAPPY FOR HIM!!! \n\n“nice one james” 💔\n\nsnape’s flashback LMFAOOO JAMES WAS ACTUALLY A DICKHEAD LOOL NO WOMDER SNAPE HATES HARRY 😭 it was so sweet seeing lupin again too but now im realising he’s lost BOTH of his best friends (lowkey ALL OF THEM if u include peter) paavam 💔 and HARRYS EVEN MORE PAAVAM BRO THE LAST FAMILY HE HAD IS GONE WTFFF\n\nthe portrait of the og order of phoenix was so sweet man everyone looked so happy . seeing sirius all smiley man aw\n\nadei cho chong??????? ENNA DA PANDRA kissing harry after u were JUST mourning ur ex is FUCKED LMFAOAOAAOA THAT SCENE WAS SO WEIRD i still cant get over her silly accent WHY DOES SHE EVEN HAS AN ACCENT WHEN SAYING SPELLS LMAOAOA\n\nmight be harry’s best look yet , when they flashbacked to goblet of fire good gosh his trim in that movie SUCKED LOOOOL 😭 lowk missing pattinson tho \n\nanyway bro dolores umpbridge ??? punda character might be my least fav person so far , on one hand i like how INSANELY mean and psychotic she is but at the same time she lowk feels cartoonish in an otherwise v dark movie . also filch D1 GLAZER LMFAOAOAOA WHEN HE GOT THE HEART SHAPED CHOCOS N HE THOUGHT IT WAS FROM HER 😭😭😭😭😭😭 POOOOSIIIII\n\nlatest music obsession is the marias . ‘no one noticed’ and ‘sienna’ ???? realllll music fam ! tamil songs of the week r ‘mass aaga’ and ‘5am’ by IFT PROD ive been getting in my tamil indie music bag lately \n\nnot tryna be a hater but there’s this one guy on this app who’s lowk the biggest loser of all time n he has 2 of the same favs as me what the fuck 💔💔💔 ok bye guys love u",
