    "review": "this movie was sooooo much better the second time around but my first review was so long that i lowk don’t have anything new to say 😭😭😭\n\ngenuinely possibly in the top 5 most visually beautiful movies ive ever seen so it SUCKS so bad that there’s no 4k print of this \nloooove the grading so much and all the creative camera movements like when he’s sneaking through the house and the camera moves like above the rooms if that makes sense  , all the FUCKING LOMG TSKES GOOD GOOOSHHHHH!!! n obviously the mirror as well faaack \n\nand the music too so so gorgeous , kadalanu extended version 💔\n\ni think his death scene is one of my favourite scenes of any movie ever tho i’m being so serious\nfrom the second he enters that hallway with the light at the end of the tunnel it’s just peak cinema.  i didn’t notice the first time but you can actually see his wounds healing and the tears in his clothes CLOSING UP the closer he gets to the light . the fact that the end of the tunnel is bathed in a blue light compared to the almost ENTIRELY red lit scenes from before, the blood clearing off his face as he gets closer , the tunnel leading to the FUCKING BEACH , her wearing PURPLE IN HER FLIPPING SAREE BRO HOOOLY COLOUR THEORY 😍😍 (i’m reaching so hard lmao) . the last thing on his mind as he dies being her singing ??? him walking INTO THE SEA THAT SHE CHERISHES SO MUCH BRO ITS SOOOOO POETIC . this might be an insane thing to say but i alr wanna rewatch it 😭😭😭😭😭\n\ni rly like surabhi’s character i think she was sooooo well written and her most significant scene where she burns all manu’s memories of priya had me sooooo conflicted . especially when u realise this was straight after prakash deleted the recorded audio of the cassette so that entire tape is gone forever now 😭 manu’s a stronger man than me cos if id lost that tape i would’ve killed myself \nbut anyway on one hand surabhi believes that her n manu are gonna have a future together and manu’s defo behaving in that way too , letting her move in with him and all but at the same time surabhi knew from the start that there was a ‘pretty princess’ in his life that he’s not quite over . idk bra i was so mad at surabhi when she did that but at the same time , the man you love holding all these memories for another woman ?? who he doesn’t even speak to anymore ?? khalas man kill me NOW \n\ni take back what i said in first review ab there not being a flow to the movie i rly like how organically it would bring back loose ends from the first film and tie them up smoothly , like the reintroduction of prabhu and soma didn’t feel forced at all . prabhu subplot was cool but i lowk think he deserved worse 😭😭 n i looooved soma’s subplot bro WHEN HE KILLED KALI I FELT SOOOO GOOD cos we never did get to see what priya wrote in her letter in side a before kali punda ate it 💔 bro manu was aura farming that entire chapter lmfaoaoao when he sees kali in the car n he goes up to him n blows smoke IN HIS FACE ??? MYYYY FUCKING BOSSS HES SO COOL 😭😭😭😭and obvs the chase scene where he thinks he’s lost him AND THEN THE TITLE TRACK PLAYS N HIS SILHOUETTE RISES THRU THE SHADOWS FUCKCKKKCKK OFFFF\n\nthe scene where he eats the food she made for her kid + his death scene alllllmost made me cry man . paavam manu \n\nthis is more like a 8.5 but the cinematography n music is ridiculous insane life changing jaw dropping awe inspiring wommaaaaala it’s so good",
