    "review": "RAJAMOULII BAAAAANGGEEERRRRR ! \n\nbro quickly this was such a fucking pain in the bum to try find a print for bro i ended up getting a JAPANESE BLURAY PRINT WTF 😭😭😭 but i ended up finding a bdremux telegram i love you 🫶🏽🫶🏽\n\ni’ll get all the gaaji out the way quickly but goodness gracious gosh kajal aggrawal the woman that you are 😻😻😻😍😍😍 SOOOOOO LENG FAM WHAT THE FAAAACK and even ram charan bro i’ve always thought this guy was leng (not in a kambi way) but his mullet 😍 gosh im so jealous \n\nbro WHY WAS THE FIRST HOUR EDGING US SO HARD FAM just LET THEM MAKE COMTACT AGAIN ALREADY PLEAASSEE 🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽 the start was so funny tho bro BLAST MOHANNN !!! HE WAS SO FUNNY bro lowkey i loved how silly the first half was like that stupid gag w the gun on his tshirt it was all so unserious n fun . icl you can SUPER tell its a ssr movie i cant point out exactly what it is but it jus has that VIBE ygm?? i was getting mega baahubali and naan ee vibes from it bro , lowkey feeling a baahubali rewatch 🫣 haven’t watched it since i was a kid fam\n\nalso set design ??!??? what the FUCK fam bro the cgi icl it was wonky at times (some of the deaths during the 100 soldiers scene yh cold 😭😭😭) but FOR 2009?!?!? bro FAAAAIRSSS THE ENTIRE KINGDOM SET WAS CRAAAZYYYYY \n\nalso the badshah ‘pull up’ scene was so cute bro how did they acc train the horses to do all that bruh . bruv i clocked ssr movies are just the heroes n villains aura farming the entire way thru cos what do you MEAN billa let that lawyer guy go jus to dash that spear across the ENTIRE FIELD AT HIM BRO that was SO UNNECESSARY 😭😭😭😭 and the 100 soldiers fight scene bro that choreography was NUTS WTFFFFFF \n\nuhhh lowk forgot everything else bro not to sound like a grumpy old man but is it jus me thats slyyyyyly annoyed that all the popular reviews for rajamouli movies r jus white ppl now 😭 especially rrr bro FAAAAACKING HELL \n\nalso i’m 1 million% gonna watch it in cinemas but im so annoyed ssr’s next movie is w mahesh babu that guy SUCKS 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭",
