    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "BAAAAANGGGEEERRRRR !!! havent said that in so long bro i haven’t used boxd in a whole week wtf 😭😭😭 who missed me 😍\n\nwatched the first 40 mins drunk w my cousins n it genuinely felt like the funniest movie of all time 😭😭 but then guys kept falling asleep so i rewatched again w my family today BROOO I LOVE THIS MOVIE ITS SO FUNNY\n\npaambu, vanthu oombu 😭🤣😭🤣🤣😭🤣😭🤣😭 AND THAT ONE SOMG WHEN THEY KEPT CUTTING IT OFF BEFORE SAYING GOTHA LOOOOOOL\nalso the score was soo good vazhitunaiye my fav song i think\n\nBRO visually SO STUNNING THE GRADING SOOOO GORGEOUS N THE BLOOM 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 yendi vittu pona was soo good too bro i lowk missed str singing in songs . n the mv???? bro i LOOOOOVE SLOW SHUTTER IT WAS SO PRETTY !! but yeah i just liked how the movie looks bro like that one indoor cafe scene his blue top against all that warm lighting 😍 good gosh bro im soooo glad i waited for it to drop on netflix \n\nLMAOOO WHEN THEY PLAYED THE SOMG FROM PREMAM THAT WAS SO FUNNY i need to rewatch that movie fam \n\nbruv anupama kayadu what the FUCK FAM GORGEOUS BEAUTIFUL STUNNING WOMEN HOOOOLY LENGERS 😍😍😍 sorry i’m gonna be gaaji rath for a bit but anu was soo pretty in this movie bruh she lowk shouldve been the main love interest . also the “do i look like a pombala?? where will i go for ambala” guy from doctor omfg 😭😭😭😭 ibr there was a lot of this movie that felt like lazy writing and fan service but IDGAF BRO IT WAS SOOO FUN I LOVED IT \n\nicl tho outside all the funny unserious moments when he had that final convo w his dad i sly felt like i was gonna cry 😭😭 if i was watching on my ones i super would’ve started tearing up bro i haaaaaate father son relationship movies so much \nalso loved anupama’s arc, loved that they ended it in a non toxic way . icl that one scene where he kept begging kayadu to resend that pic aiyoooo even for me that was kooda gaaji bro chill da \n\nOH YEAH the whole thing w the reels and the “inthaango friends” and SUTHI SUTHI LMFAOAOAOOA I WANNA RECREATE SO BAD BRO THIS MOVIES SO FUNNY \n\nalso pradeep’s hair 😍😍 i miss my curly hair sm (im never letting this pfp go) but ALL of my friends prefer me now BUT ANYWAY i do get a lot of dhanush vibes from him n it makes me feel bare nostalgic , dna hasn’t done any silly boy roles besides thiru in AAAAGEEESSSS 😭 bro lately ive been indulging in nostalgia baresssss im too scared to live in the present 😖 im yapping mb \n\nactually review over LIFE UPDATE TIME !!! icl last week bro they held this ball for tsoc and bro 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 i’ve finally found my uni boys bro oh my GOD i met sm people there and  icl i was bare hesitant to go cos i was worried everyone would be w their ppl and id be left out but BRO people were calling ME asking where i was to come JOIN THEM BRO I FELT SO LOVED 😭😭 n even the tsoc pres who invited me was like “not in a selfish way but im bare happy u didn’t go out in term 1 cos u wouldve been part of the popular group n u wouldn’t chat to me” bro FUUUUCK I FUMBLED SO HARD 😭😭 and then even after the event bare lf the ppl i met added me on socials and popped up to ME and were posting pics WITH ME OM THEIR STORIES WTF 😭 sorry i acc sound like a loser w no social interaction but u man this is the uni experience ive been praying for ever since even queen mary last year bro 😭😭 hoping ill run a motive w some of the uni guys this easter n ill finally stop complaining that im a lonely bastard . uhhhh vera enna oh yeah i cooked fried rice for my entire fam n they FUCKIJG LOVED IT BRO CHEF RATH IN THA BUILDIIIINGGGGGGG !!! also after the ball i almost got caught drinking by my parents my entire life was almost khalas 💔 sari i lowk don’t remember anything else love u !\n\nsong of the week is paayum theeye again bro i was obsessed w it back in october n im obsessed again cos #nostalgia",
