    "review": "💔💔💔 very unfortunately not a banger \n\nbro i haven’t been to the cinemas since amaran what’s acc happened to me 😭 anyway i was so excited for this movie cos the vikram comeback is soooo overdue (HE COULDVE HAD IT W MAHAAN BUT OTT RELEASE FAAAAACK) \n\neven tho he has so many stinkers as of late vikram’s still one of my fav actors , guy might have the most aura in all of kollywood (not to glaze) and he looks GOOD here bro like HES ONE GOOOORGEOUS BRUDDA IN THIS MOVIE !!! \nlmao i was sat next to this old couple n in the interval we were talking ab the movie n the auntie was like ‘vikram romba vadiva irrukaan” n the fucking UNCLE GAVE THE MADDEST SIDE EYE LOOOL THEY WERE BARE CUTE\n\nbro going cinema on ur ones is so lame when ur sat next to a group of ppl bro i must’ve looked like a LOSER WTF 😭 i was ab to shout laigini but every movie we’ve been to (thangalaan n goat) we’re both stinkers shes gonna think my taste is so ass 😭😭😭😭😭\n\nanyway music , bro i could make love to gvp for 40 days straight the SCORE IN THIS MOVIE ??? MMM 😩😩😩 not to be a sana kanni again but the mass song they used for the elevation scenes was lowk dry mahaan is one of the best scores in tamil cinema in aaaagessssss . that one love song at the start was bare cute but the rest were kinda dry \n\nim sorry gaaji rath is back bro dushara???????? 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 gosh how is she SO LENG BRO EVERY MOVIE IVE EVER SEEN HER IN SHES ACC ULAGA AZHAGAIYA DEVATHAI BRO SOOOO STUNNING ok Sorry again \n\nu guys know by now im a Slut for long takes bro THIS MOVIE????? arun kumar was cumming in my eyes bro THE RUMOURS WERE TRUE 17 MIN LONG TAKE WTFFFFFF 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 there were loads of one takes like that like at the festival there’s tons of rly long shots with so much happening n it’s like how do you even organise something like this bro . he’s so goated anyways yeah that LONG TAKE FAAAAACK cos it MOVES BETWEEN LIKE FIVE DIFF LOCATIONS N THERES STUFF HAPPENING IN THE BACKGROUND N THERES SO MUCH PYRO N SOOO MUCH DIALOGUE BUT ALSO A LOT OF FIGHT CHOREO bro what the FUCK 😭😭😭 OMFG i don’t wanna spoil but this is a kutty mild spoiler so skip rest of the para but the FUCKING CAMERA MOUNTS OMTO A CAR FOR A FEW MINS N THEN COMES BACK OFF TO A WHOOOOLE NEW SET??????? YO WTF 😭😭😭😭😭😭 \n\nalso vikram n dushara icl man 💔 they were konjam cute but i acc can’t get it it out my head that she is his SONS AGE BRO PISS OFF\n\nanyways unfortunately i didn’t like the padam da i have to say i think it was bare unique them starting the movie from the middle of the story n slooowly revealing everything , but i jus found it kinda hard to empathise w the characters at some points . bro during the flashback a completely brand new character dies n they spend a little while mourning ab it but like we haven’t even heard of this guy the entire first half of the movie so im kinda jus like bro idgaf 😭😭😭 n honestly cos vikram’s such a like nonchalant n mysterious character he doesn’t say much so a lot of the scenes i acc jus dont know what he’s doing 😭 left me confused a lot which made me kinda bored . ill prolly watch the prequel but idk ab in cinemas . \n\nalso idk why but some of the sequences were kinda giving last of us 2 vibes bro that one scene lowk gave me golf club ptsd 💔\n\nclimax was cool tho i liked the set up \ni love sjs as a villain but this role feels far too similar to maanadu raayan saripodhaa like pls have some variety 😭😭 even dushara felt similar to her role in raayan . also soma from sse yooo !",
