    "review": "binged the whole thing in one go scheisse \n\nalso watched the first 15 mins in tamil dub w my parents loool \n\nentirely one takes FUCKING HOW 😭😭😭 MOVING IN N OUT OF CARS , MOVIJG THRU TIGHT SPACES WITHIUT BUMPING INTO ACTORS , MEMORISING DIALOGUE , ALL THE CHOREO EVERYTGING BRO WTFFFF \n\ni assumed it was gonna be invisible cuts like 1917 but it was ACTUALLY JUS ONE SHOT BRO LIKE ITS BASICALLY A STAGE PLAY BUT EVEN MOOOREEEE COMPLEX FAM sorry im gonna gush on about this one take thing for so long but you guys KNOW this is always my fav thing ab movies like the vds 17 min long take ???? bruv fuck that FOUR OME HOUR LOMG TAKES ??? 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 anyway i love how seamlessly it transitions between the sequences like when one character exits frame the next sequence starts w PERFECT timing and i can’t evencBRGIN to understand how much rehearsals and planning had to go into it beforehand to perfect all the timings and locations faaaaack 😭😭😭😭 id be absolutely shitting myself after like 15 mins of filming bro like thats SO MUCH that we’d have to reshoot if someone messed up 😭 anyways that chase scene in ep2 bro what the fuck ?!?!? i’m assuming it was cg window BUT EITHER WAY HOW DID THEY GET THE CAMERAMAN THRU THE WINDOW??? WITHOUT SHAKING UP THE CAMERA BARES WTF and WHEN did they transition the cam to a drone ??????? BRO WHEN IT SYARTED FUCKING FLYING I WAS SO SHOCKED N THEN SWITCHED BACKKK TO HANDHELD BRO HOWWW but they posted the bts of all the hard to shoot scenes in twitter alr thats so goated .\n\ncoordinating an entire secondary school like that asw is insane bro they must’ve put SO much work into this . score was incredible asw , including the children’s choir at the end of ep2 was so good bro i miss being in choir lool\n\ni remember seeing all the tweets when it first came out that it was connor’s first ever acting gig like AT ALL  and bro u cannot tell AT ALL !!! bro this kid’s RIDICULOUS also they shot episode 3 first n thats ARGUABLY the most demanding performance in the whole show bro owen’s insane \n\nok SUPER DUPER SPOILERS FROM NOW ! ‼️⚠️bro when they showed that cctv footage 😭🤯😭🤯😭🤯 like i kinda assumed that he would’ve done it but i guess i thought this was going in a false accusation kinda way espec cos his acting was so believable but that fucking tape 😭 n stephen graham man dare i say one of the uk’s best actors , his change in demeanor after was incredible . ep3 asw is where owen shines asw n i loooooove the small detail of him eating the sandwich even tho he didn’t like it , played into the whole thing w him needing power and validation so well . and in ep4 asw i looove the symbolism of the camerawork yk like how otw to wainwrights it was mounted on the van and nice and spacious but the way back home it was intimate and claustrophobic \n\ni know i was jus banging on ab how much i looovwd the one take cinematography but i rly wish they’d broken it for the last ep to show what was going on w jamie yk . regardless great show \n\ni’m sooooo glad they spoke ab the whole red pill misogyny andrew tate nonsense asw bro that the whole alpha male sigma male stuff is genuinely so disgusting and the impact it has on impressionable teenagers n violence on women needs to be spoken about more \n\nthe ending 💔💔💔",
