    "review": "baaangerrrr !! \n\ni’m lowk sad ive watched all of mari’s films (NOT watching maaamanan) \n\nSaNa again bro omg 😭😭😭😭😭😭 the theme tune is top 5 best elevation scores EVER DUDE FAAAACK \n\nmy fav thing ab mari’s films tho is they’re packed w SO much symbolism i started researching all the meanings straight after the movies done .\n\nthe mahabaratha reference is the most interesting to me cos ive been meaning to read that for aaaaageeesss bro , i love that dhanush’s character is litr named after karna from the book and his story even has a lot of similar plot points too . the romance wasn’t that important ngl but i liked that they made it so draupadi actually accepted karnan in this movie , fits with the whole anti caste theme yk\n\nand the thing w the little girls wearing deity heads was SOOOO powerful dude like i was in awe everytime they’re on screen , espec during the uttradeenga yeppo music video (SOOO GOOD MV BTW) when there’s several of them . i love love looove how it shows that even the most marginalised women have a sort of like sacredness/divinity in them bro that was so well done . \n\nobviously the whole thing w the donkey in the first half was well done too i wasn’t expecting to be so moved by that subplot 😭😭😭 i litr could not stop smiling during the interval bro \n\nmy ranking is pariyerum > karnan > vaazhai",
