    "review": "i’m SINGLE AND IM YOUNGUUUUUUUU !!!! \n\nb b b BAAAANGERRRR \n\nthe first half of this movie is acc peak comfort film man so so cute and funny\n\nhowever lowk i need the amma amma song to be wiped off the face of the earth i litr get a lump in my throat everytime i hear it 😭😭😭 n this is only like my second time ever watching the movie in full asw so that whole 15 mins before the scene happens i was just like 💔💔💔💔💔 dhanush kutty povaatha \n\nalso amala paul good GOSH 😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍 she’s been my crush ever since raatsasan i love her \n\nsamuthirakani another comfort actor for me but every time i see him i cant forget “wommaala board aadra na board mattum aadanom” sorry worst spelling ever but i love that scene i love hearing ppl swear in tamil bro makes me giggle everytime im such a kid \n\nalso this FUCKING ALBUM BRO??? every tamil club i’ve ever gone to udhangadha sanghu and what a karvaad are played WITHOUT FAIL BRO THE DNA COMBO R SO GOATEDDDD !!! lowkey im gonna be so sad when uni ends cos where else can i go clubbing n they play tamil music bro family parties DO NOT COUNT I WANNA BE A KUDIKAARAN !!! \n\nanyway this movie so so quotable bruh like ive lowk seen 40% of it jus as reels 😭😭😭  so many funny one liners man i was litr laughing OUT LOUD so much of the first half \n\nalso his dogs called karry potter lol bro ever since i finished the series i never realised how present it is in pop culture like i was playing an assassins creed game the other day n i found this note thing called “mysterious list” AND IT WAS ALL THE HORCRUXES n the last one was a ? i finally understand the lore now 🤭🤭 also reserved the first book at the lib but it’s not available for another 3 weeks LLL piracy time 🏴‍☠️🙏🏽😭\n\nlowkey half of the funny moments are in dhanushs body language n expressions like when amala hits him the second time n he jus lays on the ground frozen for a min 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 OR WHEN HE PUNCHED THAT ONE GUY N TOLD HIM TO FALL AWAY FROM THE BIKE LMAOOO bro the bike is my fav running gag ever \n\nraghuvaran such a cool character bro i wanna be more like him irl . also lowkey ik it’s a thing to get on to brown boys for being momma’s boys but i never understood that like am i not allowed to love my mum bro thats my AMMA 😭😭😭  also i love love looooved the father son relationship in this movie bro they only rly had one emotional scene but that one scene reaaaalllyyyy hurt bruh when dhanush was crying in his room n he went to comfort him ☹️☹️☹️☹️☹️☹️☹️☹️☹️☹️",
