    "review": "damn why did i lowk not fw this movie as much as tiktok did 😭😭😭 icl tho its not insane to say this movie saved my life tn i jus needed to be outside at any cost \n\nludwig goransson 😍😍😍 everytime bro this guy litr produces the most insane gorgeous scores EVER bro FACK \n\nalso cinematography holy gosh bro it’s one of my life goals to see a 70mm movie at the BFI i fumbled today but nolan’s odyssey WE WILL BE THERE !!! all the magic hour shots were absolutely insane bro such a pretty movie \n\nidk how they did the double acting so well like there’d be scenes in mersal where both vijay’s would cross n i’d be like 🤯🤯 how tf but in this movie they’d cross and EVEN FIGHT AND HUG AND ALL WHILST THE CAMERA IS MOVING BRO WHAT THE FUCK ?!?!??!?? like in atlee movies it’s always stationary cam but THE FIGHT SCENES BRO THE CAM IS CONSTANTLY MOVIJG N BOTH MBJ’s WOULD BE IN FRAME BRO HOOOOWWEEEE DID THEY DO IT \n\nunfortunately tho it jus didnt connect w me as well as i wanted it to laigini asked to go good bad ugly today asw i lowk should’ve jus gone w her😭😭😭\n\nanyway guys not to glaze SaNa again but the retro side a tape?!? literally fuck me in the bum bro when i heard that violin theme in the teaser i was worried it’d jus be in the score and he’d never release it BUT HE TURNED IT INTO A WHOLE FUCKING SOOONNGGGG yk i even dm’d the violinist when the teaser dropped (got aired tho lol) cos i rly wanted to hear the full piece. and thats JUST SIDE A BRO HES GONNA DROP ANOTHER EP FOR IT LETS FUCKING GOOOO I LOVE U SANA !!! \n\nanyways movie was nice",
