    "review": "ran out of selveraj movies to watch so i’m watching the movies he was a AD for lol \nit’s so cool how u can see ram’s influences on selveraj’s storytelling tho like there’s a lot of symbolism in here similar to his movies \n\nngl tho im far too stupid to understand this movie tho it has a lot of criticisms against MNC’s n globalisation n i jus did a world economy essay on that AND DID A PARA ON INDIA TOO LOL but anyway i lowk couldn’t fully understand what the movie was tryna say ygm . imo globalisations been v good for india’s development but i am NOT AB TO TURN THIS INTO AN ECON ESSAY LMAOOO MBMB \n\nNOOOOOO THE WAY THEY FLIPPED THE WAY SHE SAYS NEJAMA VA SOLRIYA 💔💔 \n\nabsolutely adoooored the cinematography bro espec the contrast between his childhood flashbacks where everything’s all nature and colourful and saturated n then the present day it’s all in these bleak buildings n dark streets n its v monochrome colour grading . n the slow shutter chase scenes yk i love those 🤭🤭\n\nalbum was okay (lyrics were INSANE tho) like i think the songs in the movie were good espec their placements in the movie but i don’t think id ever listen to the songs individually but the SCORE?? not even the score just the sound design in general maybe its just cos its a old movie but its all very echoey and not like distorted but idk chaotic ygm espec how they’d make his voice seem muffled in some of the more insane scenes ygm . oh yh the main theme ??? niki sent it to me this morning n ive been in love ever since thats lowk why i wanted to watch this tn lol \n\nalso i liked anjali’s character a lot it seemed like she was prabhakar’s one ray of hope for humanity in the same way as jo pariyerum perumal . when he’s with her he gets a flashback to childhood him like a flashback to the last time he was happy in some way ygm also love love looooved how at the end she makes him transition to his like ‘good’ self yk cleaning his beard up n fixing his glasses n all good movie . n him feeling like if he has to lose anandhi he has to lose himself too idk it was cool man",
