    "review": "so cuteeee first half \n\nmissed this kinda campy kinda corny humour u get in these commercial movies , i’ve been watching bare serious movies lately (mari selveraj 😖😖) so this was a nice change of pace \n\nthe BUS SCENE LMFAOAOAOAOAOA I SHOULDVE RECORDED MY REACTION (mb deeksha) COS WHAT THE HELL LOOOOL \n\nmusic so good too i love inken inkem\n\nibr YES the movie was creepy at times YES the storyline was kinda dumb YES it was still cute tho 😭 vijay n rashmika were both mega red flags (imo) n it becomes generic in the last 40 mins but WHOOO CARESSS ALSO NITHYA MENON !!! i was jus in a bad mood last night n this movie saaavedd meeee !!\n\nalso vijay what a lengers wtf 🫣 if i’m being soooo honest tho KINGDOM LOOK IS CRAAAAZYYYY that beard sheissseeee im tryna get like u bro 😍that hridayam lopala mc was COLDDD i wasn’t that interested in the movie at first but icl the whole partners in crime pretending to be in love but then acc falling in love YOOOO IM GONNA EAT TS UPPPP😛😛😛 also the song was cold asw is ani back ?!?!? \n\nalso booked hit 3 tickets on my ones BROO MY ACCOM NEXT YEAR IS A TEN MILN WALKFROM THE CINEMA LFGGGGGGGGGG",
