    "isLiked": true,
    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "BAAAANGERRRRR\n\nbro am i watching the same movie as u guys WHERES ALL THIS HATE COMING FROM ?!?!!? THIS IS CINEMMAAAAAA\n\nnani is my GOAT MAN I LOVEEE HIMMM MY MOST WATCHED ACTOR OF 2024 YK?? rly started exploring his work after hi nanna n this guy has SOOOO many bangers man n he’s SO VERSATILE BRO CAN U BELIEVE THIS AND ANTE SUNDARANIKI IS THE SAME ACTOR??? HELL NAH 😭😭\n\nalso him self funding this makes me love it so much more cos bro this movies 18+ in the uk i can’t rmb the last south indian movie that dropped here that was 18+ only like EVER !!! leo had a 18+ rating but they cut it to make it 15 n im SOOOO glad nani didn’t do that here, cos the gore in this film ?????? gooodnessss gracious \n\ni’ve struggled to enjoy these violent serious movies for ages like i couldn’t even finish gangs of wasseypur n even pudhupettai didn’t speak to me like that but THIS??? WOOOOWWWIEEE (is my taste just ass lol) \n\nbro the last 40 mins . 😍🤩🤯 what the FUUUUCKKK SO MANY DIFF CREATIVE KILLS SO MUCH BLOOD N BRO THE CJNEMATOGRPAHY ?!?!!? ngl the first few fights were kinda ass n especially after seeing retro they defo felt a lil too chaotic n hard to follow but brother the second half of this film. maaagiccc it feels like the entire film is just building towards the third act so idk if the first half would be enjoyable on rewatch but pls give this movie a go just for the final act man cos despite there being so much gore it doesn’t ever feel like it’s jus a blur/meaningless cos they keep doing unique things and amazing camera movements bro THE CAMERA WORK WAS ASTOUUUUNDING !!! \n\nthere were a couple long takes (not 15 mins like retro/vds) but they’re PURELY fights with VERY tight quick camera movements and THE KILLS R ALSO VIOLENT SO ITS LIKE IDEK HOW THEY EDITED THIS BRO WTFFF !!! bro there were a LOT of scenes where i litr heard my entire theatre like GASP OUT LOUD BRO I LOOOOVE HOW CREATIVE THE VIOLENCE WAS\n\nand nani man 😭😭😭😭aura BOSS bro the whole time hes in the white suit i was genuinely in awe bro hes jus so so so cool on screen ALSO THIS IS MY FIRST NANI MOVIE IN THE CINEMA WHAAAAT??? but yeah he was sooo leng i love his hair n the contacts asw??? yeah cold man \n\nn that scene where all of nani’s boys join the fight n it’s jus a massive brawl like what the fuck man i litr had my mouth open the entire scene like thats some INSAAAANEEEE CHOREO 😭 im tryna keep this no spoilers but the ending fight was so so so so soooo cool \n\nmb this reviews all over the place but basically its just a whole lot of fun man very interesting very cool also YOOOO THE POST CREDIT SCENE???? INVOOOOOOOLVEEEEE MEEE\n\nmusic didn’t move me that much but the score was v cool\n\nalso negatives quickly bro this villain fucking sucks  😭😭😭 i hate how many english dialogues they added man he rly felt like a ubisoft villain n the whole ctk thing didn’t help EITHER LOOOOL bro felt like the most generic far cry villain ever n his SHIT TRIM TOO FUCKS SAKEEEE 😭😭😭 but nani more than made up for it bro he was so cool man i loved seeing him in a more psychotic avatar but PLEASEEEE MORE ROMCOMS I NEED ANOTHER HI NANNA OR ANTE PLEAAASEEEE",
