    "review": "men ☕️\n\nsoooo well written movie but i need to rewatch this cos i can feel myself starting to lose interest in not jus movies but lowk all of my hobbies bro WHAT is happening to me and WHY 😭😭😭 i wasn’t as locked in as i wanted to be life’s been getting the better of me 🙏🏽💔 will defo revisit when im okay again\n\ni’ve made sm friends at uni lately but im getting so overwhelmed by everything that i keep ignoring everyone by accident bro what the FUCK IS GOING ON \n\nanyways 😭 so cool seeing sana there this shouldn’t come as a surprise but the album is so so so pretty again , man i was WAAIIIIITTING for manidhi to play that’s my absolute fav \n\nv good looking movie but again not surprised for a subbaraj movie sorry bruh this is acc the worst review of all time",
