    "review": "YOOOOOOOO WTF 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 what the FUUUUCKKKK WAS THAT ENDING LMFAOOOO bro i was litr PACING AROUND MY ROOM IN SHOCK LOOOL like i knew there was gonna be a plot twist it’s litr nolan BUT WHAAAAATTTTTT 😭😭😭😭😭😭🤯🤯🤯🤯🤯\n\nalso that license plate tattoo stood out so much to me so i rewinded thru the film a couple times BROOOOOO in some scenes the plate is SG1371U in some scenes it’s SG137IU BRO WTFFFFFFFF THIS GUY M HIS FLIPPING ATTENTION TO DETAIL OMFFGGGG\n\nguy pearce lowk lengers bro his eyes are SO blue\n\ni looooveed and hated the way the timeline was cut up bro i rmb seeing that one reel of him explaining the plot years ago but acc seeing it play out is INSAAAANEEEE dude but lowk it felt the movie was edging me bra switching between the timeline jus when it gets REALLY good\n\nbut this nolan guy bra how do u even begin to piece together a script like this 😭😭lowk wanna read the og story it’s based on now , bro this and inception it’s acc ridiculous how they craft a movie like this let alone create the concept dude good gosh \n\nsammy jenkins would absolutely love tiktok and reels \n\n“we create prisons for ourselves because facing reality is harder” bruuhhhhh mb i wanted to analyse guy pearce’s character better but 3am lowk bare tired gn 😛😛😛\n\nabsolutely gonna watch ghajini now cos my english movie burn out is NOT OVER 😭😭 i was starting to zone out a lil but im hoping ghajinis romance track will keep me locked in",
