    "review": "nan samudra neenu 💔😭💔😭💔\n\nmannnn 2 years since this incredible film came out perfect time for my biannual rewatch 🙏🏽 i’ve been struggling to focus on movies lately i can barely get myself to sit down n watch one n even when i do i lowk go on my phone for a lot of it but THISSS MOVIEEE MAN 😭😭😭 GODDDDDD\n\ni lowk got all my deep analytical thoughts out the way in my last review but brooo ! i saw this reel of the director talking ab the scene where she’s about to give manu the food and he doesn’t turn up to visitation , right after that where she throws the food away , there’s an extra in a blue shirt who walks past her who represents manu leaving her which URGHHH HEMANTH RAO SUCH A TASTEFULLY DIRECTED MOVIE WOOOWWWIEEEE \n\ngenuinely wasn’t expecting to cry this time around but FUCK bro as soon as he starts writing that letter and kanmareya kaade plays I CANT CONTROL IT THE TEARS JUST ATART FLOWING 😭😭\n\ncouldn’t do a double bill this time cos i had work 💔 but man im looking forward to side b again that movie only gets better everytime i see it . i love this movie so much bro its similar to la la land like everytime i see a reel about it i get this burning urge to rewatch it n it never really gets boring . entire first 40 mins asw im just cheesing the entire way thru man theyre SOOOO CUTE FUCK PRASHANTH FUCK SOMA !!!! prakash manu priya so cute \n\nkathe 🤞🏽",
