    "id": "diary-447",
    "title": "One Battle After Another",
    "releaseYear": 2025,
    "releaseDecade": "2020s",
    "director": "Paul Thomas Anderson",
    "language": "English",
    "movement": "Prestige Crime, Sci-Fi & Thrillers",
    "runtimeMinutes": 150,
    "watchedDate": "2025-10-06",
    "loggedDate": "2025-10-07",
    "rating": 3.5,
    "isRewatch": false,
    "isLiked": false,
    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "WHOLE FLAT CINEMA MOTIVE LETS GOOOOO\n\ncinematography wow wow wow 😍 we lacked so hard by not watching this in imax man , cos the framing of some of these shots were BEAUUUTIFUL they kept switching between these stunning super wide shots n these really layered dirty close ups and it was just so so pretty man . especially all the car scenes bro GOOD GOOSSSHHH obviously the climax car chases w the rolling hills was SO cool but every scene involving a car they kept mounting the cams on the doors and the way the cars rose in n out of frame in the hill chase was 😍😍😍\n\nby far my fav part was the score tho , got added to my library INSTANTLYYYY !! \n\nfirst leo movie in the cinema asw 🤞🏽 n he didn’t disappoint he was great . i rly liked how there wasn’t a distinct plot yk we were more jus watching these characters lives unfold i thought it was cool . didn’t feel like the 4.4/5 best movie of the year that guys were making it out to be tho . altho for 3 hours this actually flew by bro very very well paced movie \n\ni do think the political message behind it was great tho especially with all the ice raids going on in america it felt super relevant and suuuper anti white saviour man like the fact the guy was trying to m off his daughter jus cos she’s black ?? 😭😭😭 also REVERSE RAPE?? SEMEN DEMON???? WHY WAS THIS MOVIE ACTUALLY FUNNY LMFAOOOO but yeah all the scenes w the white nationalists felt so over the top but then u realise there’s guys who genuinely think like this it’s insane . also comparing the way the white resistance group was all “ahh give me the passcode or i can’t help u blah blah” compares to sensei who was down to help the SECOND he saw bob in distress n his whole tight knit community n the way he helps them out w housing n jobs n they return the favour in every way they can (the skaters, the hospital escape) it was really well done \n\nanyway life update !!!!!!! \n\nindian movies have SPOOIIIILLLEEEDDD me bro cos 2.50 hours w no intermission is CRAZY 😭😭 after 2 hours my bladder was KHALAS bro i couldn’t hold ts in 😭\n\nlowk my biggest takeaway from this movie was that I WANT A MUSTANNNGGGG the last year i’ve been saving up for a  2018 a4/320d (only £6k left to go 😍😍😍)  (Inshallah e63s one day) sorry the basic brown boy in me is coming out but anyway bro tim smith was WHIZZIIINNGGGG IN THAT MUSTANG HOLY SHIIITTTT and did u hear that flipping engine rumble 🤤🤤🤤🤤🤤n the way it PULLS TOO BRO WTFFF THAT SUV GOT LAAAPPPEEEEDDDD every scene w the blue mustang in it was jus aura 😍😻😍 gosh sorry im getting gaaji over a car let me lock in \n\nanyway this weeks lowk been rough for me but these flatmates r saaavviiiinngggg me man a couple of them are acc movie buffs asw so the way we were analysing this film after woooowwwww im gonna try force them to make a boxd account . i remember i was super nervous meeting all these brand new ppl but we lowk jus clicked n im so grateful . but yeah man super cool guys n i realise every time they shout me to go out the social anxiety in me tells me aaaaa these r new ppl what if they don’t like me but i force myself to go everytime n i have so much fun every time n idk brav im jus proud of myself for not being a pussio anymore ygm . also there was EIGHT of us at the cinema bro do yk how much ive been longing to have a big friendship group like that 😭😭😭 is my life finally turning around for the better 😭😭😭 n i don’t feel like im pretending to be someone else around them yk like im acc being myself n they still love my company n we always laugh together asw n its like damn maybe im not boring ?!?!?!? W life altho i do wanna make more tamil friends 😭😭😭\n\nerrrrmmmmmm that’s all methinks back in gym finally we’re getting big 💪🏽 compared myslef to last year and biceps WHAAAAATTTTT WHOOOOOSSSS THAT ?????? #FitRath finally finally finally started applying for finance internships too and my God i can’t believe i used to be so smart bro im wasting my potential 💔💔 im v behind my peers but we’re bringing it back bro slowly but surely \n\nanyway bye love u 😜😜",
