    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "im sorry in advance but i acc liked this movie 😭😭😭 i will speak ab the negatives later tho \n\ni wouldn’t have been nearly as excited to watch this movie if it wasn’t for this ULTRA SUPER DUPER BANGER ALBUM COS WTFFFFFF 😭😭 my top 10 songs this week have been the entire dude album + the rest of sai’s songs , i acc feel so bad for my friends cos ive jus been spamming them w snaps of me singing the songs . but anyway i’ve been riiinnnsssiiiinngggg the album lately , n i dont think i would’ve even watched this in the cinema if not for the music . but brooo hearing oorum blood in the cinema omfg 😫😫😫 WHAT AN EXPERIENCE BRO HOOOLLYYYY n kannukulla (lowk top 5 sai for me) has been MY SINGLE MOST REPLAYED SONG but brother 😭😭😭 the context of the song in the movie lowk ruined it for me . still a banger tho \n\nthe score ill be honest it was just oorum blood remixed 382 diff times , BUT PLS STILL DROP THAT SCOREEE also so many diff acoustic versions of oorum blood n nallaru po?? bro release ALL OF THEM EXTENDED ALBUM WHEN??? i never rly got the sai hate like ya he’s a nepo baby but his music is phenomenallll to me i will never complain ab more sai music 😭 mayb i am just basic \n\nalso icl this movie was FUNNY bro mostly jus cos im a stupid baby n tamil swear words make me giggle so much bro when sarath kumar says “enda nethi enna kena punda nu elithi irruka” 😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂😭 genuinely burst out laughing bro but ya i found the movie super funny MOST of time. i was acc ab to watch this movie w my parents what would i have acc done if they saw me laughing at them saying punda 😭\n\nalso i took charlotte to the cinema to watch it she’s like the biggest vellakaari tamil person i know n even she started laughing at some of the dialogues felt so good\n\ntwo things i REALLY wasn’t expecting tho:\n\nthe FIGHT SCENES DUDE?? there were only like 2 but bro they were SOOOOO WELLLLL choreographed, that intro fight my GODDDD so few cuts , the cam was moving about so much but everything was easy to follow like it was a nice chaotic high energy fight scene , fantastic intro bro well flipping done . again w the climax too bro i love love loooove the fight scenes\n\nalso the movie is GORGEOUS BRO the intermission especially that lighting ouuuufffff 😫😫😫 so so pretty the colours the bloom the composition everything wow wow wow stunning . \n\nalso i went into the movie blind (except for the songs obv) cos one of my friends does that n i always wanted to know what it feels like but bro 😭😭😭 mayb i shouldn’t have for this movie cos i did NOT REALISE IT WAS ABOUT COUSIN MARRIAGE LMFAOOOOO lowkey incredibly tmi but cousin marriage is MEGA PTSD FOR ME LOOOL I WAS BUGGING OUT AHAHAA n imagine poor charlotte bro first tamil movie in the cinema n its about incest like 😭😭😭 it made some of the romance scenes soooo uncomfortable cos they acc had a lot of chemistry n if they jus took that bit out n made them family friends or something instead i would’ve ADOOOOREEDDDD this movie \n\nthis movie leans faaaarrrrr to much into incel territory tho to the point it’s v hard to ignore n there’s no type of downfall or redemption in the story either like they’re lowk trying to make us feel bad for him which is like aaaaaa idk bro like at least in dragon he was a dickhead but he had that downfall moment where all his mistakes finally got to him yk , like he had that rock bottom moment as a result of his actions n it’s only after he changes that he sees success again but there’s nothing like that in this movie . n i said the movie was funny most of the time cos there are FAR too many sex jokes n like jokes ab women that lowk jus weren’t that funny 😭😭😭 like bro the “enna di bittu padam maari pose pandra” brother come ooonnnnn let’s be serious . ts does NOT pass the bechdel test 🙏🏽😂 but yea man im hoping in LIK he moves away from this incel type of character . he’s defo funny n i like his more quirky kinda comedy but i feel like it’ll get outdated fast if he doesn’t move onto more like , idk not mentally insane characters ??? \n\nanyway mamitha absolutely stunning gorgeous beautiful but who’s surprised 😻😻😻😻😻😻😻😻 gonna try watch bison this week too paarpom",
