    "isLiked": true,
    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "mild spoilers \n\nquick warning if u guys didn’t know i am a dog hater 💔 i’ve had the maddest ptsd ab dogs ever since sri lanka when i was like 8 n i never recovered 😭😭 so i really believed this movie wasn’t gonna move me at all \n\nthat being said\ni cried like a fucking pussio 😭😭😭😭😭😭 i can’t believe they made me care ab a dog bro i was INVESTEDDD in this movie , bro baby charlie omfg 😭😭 THEY WERE SOOOO CUTE AT THE START when charlie (or thu thu) kept following him everywhere n jus being a naughty bastard AAA IT WAS SO ADORABLE\n\ni had to keep taking breaks to go chill with my cats bro i think if i watched this alone at my uni accom i would’ve KILLED myself 😭 bro i was watching it w aruny n u should’ve seen the way he was looking at me after w the most love in his eyes ive ever seen i love my kitties\n\nalso whys this the most EXPRESSIVE DOG OF ALL TIME LMAO i couldn’t tell when it was cgi n when it was real cos FLIPPING HELL SOME OF THE FACES CHARLIE MADE LOOOL and some of her gestures man like hugging dharma and tapping him all the time n the way she woke him up urghhhh cute cute cute (i can’t believe im saying this ab a dog btw) \n\nhitler uncle is crazy but the transition to uncle ❤️\n\nrakshit looks so leng here btw like i thought he looked good at the start w the short hair but JEEZZZ THE SECOND HALF W THE LONGER CURLY HAIR WOOWWIIEEE !! but nah rakshit was so so good bro i saw a shade of sse side B manu in there for a sec when he went to the breeders yard . devika also zoo wee mama 😻😻😻 but bro when dharma laughs for the first time it’s so 😫😫😫 such a satisfying moment ugh i looooveee the way they wrote his character n the way u can see his dynamic w charlie affecting his behaviour w other ppl too like him starting to care for the kids in the colony n the old ppl at the idly kadai and his work mentee (n the guy he gave the promotion too PRAKASHA HIIIII)\n\nshe ran all the way to the hospital for him 😢😢😭😭☹️😞😞😞 i think thats when i was really starting to feel like wow i kinda care about this dog fack\n\nTHE MATCHING SHIRTS LMFAOAOAOA THAT WAS SO FUNNY bro this movie was unexpectedly funny like the HITCHHIKER SCENE LOOOL and all the scenes w adrika such a well written relationship \n\ni liked how diverse the music was they had a spanish song in there n even a qawalli one that song was a banger \n\nthe fake dream gave me sse ptsd all over again bro FUCK that scene \n\nBOBBY SIMHAAAAA SO CUTE also rakshit shetty speaking in tamil whaaaatttt !! i rly loved his side quest it was a massive character arc for dharma imo \n\nthey saved each other i liked that a lot\n\ni hope i can be someone’s charlie one day",
