    "review": "finally got to watch this movie in the cinema that too in leicester square imax bro THIRD BIGGEST SCREEN IN THE UK BTW that too for ONEEEEE NIGHT ONLYY\n\nthey had tickets for BFI too which is THEEEE SINGLE BIGGEST in all of uk but in hindi 🤮🤮 ah hell nah \n\nanyway i watched in telugu audio n icl 😭😭😭 WHAT is mahishmathi bro MAGIZHMATHI VAAZHGA !!! kattappa’s voice was so weird but it defo made me realise how SHIT prabhas’ tamil dubbing artist was . but anyway bro my FUCKKKK THE IMAX SPEAKERS !!! \n\nhearing the score in the cinema was an EXPERIENCEEEEEE DUDE i was litr shazamming some of the scores during the movie cos i wanted to listen to them for the car ride home 😭😭 but the saviour + the ending of birth of an avenger, FUUUUCKINGGG HELL thats REAL MUSIC BRO M M KEERAVANI YOURE MY GOAT !!! but yeah even tho the songs were in telugu they were still so sogood and orey oor ooril man 😭😭😭😭😭 so so beautiful the way those drums THUMPED the entire seat n the gorgeous music vid too wow wow wow . however 💔💔💔 where the FUCK is manogari bro lite my fav song on the ENTIRE ALBUM WHERE IS IT !!! i was so sad they cut that out \n\nspeaking of cutting stuff out man i cant liiiieeeeeee i wasn’t a massive fan of the way they cut this 💔💔 don’t get me wrong both the baahu films r fast paced n a lot of action but this epic literally has ZERO downtime bro its jus STRSIGHT BALLS TO THE WALLS FIGHTING n it DEFO got overwhelming at a point 😭😭😭 \n\nmild mild mild spoilers !! \ni lowk didn’t like that they cut out so much of the avantika lore bro like that was such a smooth n compelling way for baahu to want to save devasena n if i hadn’t seen both movies before i think i wouldn’t have cared as much yk . i wasn’t as immersed this time as i was when i double\nbilled . they did it again lowkey with devasena too by cutting out kanna nee thoonguda which is just like bro ssr WHAT DO U HAVE AGAINST ROMANCEEE \n\nspoilers over \nlike yes the action in this movie genuinely is jaw dropping but the emotional beats in the full movies r what really elevate it to another level ykkk , its what a lot of the mass movies today r lacking n baahubali kinda perfected it . n icl it was 3.50 hours anyway they could’ve jus made it a full 4 or even like 4.10 n nobody would’ve complained 😭😭 or mayb they could’ve trimmed down the war scenes instead . speaking of the runtime bro even at FOUR FUCKING HOURS LONG i wasnt that bored altho i did have to pee 3 times\n\ni got to see the spears colliding n destroying bhalla’s carriage scene jn the cinema my life is complete 😭😭😭😭😭😭 my GOD BRO THE WAY I WAS GENUINELY OIERALLY SCREAMING IN THE CINEMA WHEN I SAW THAT SCENE BRO THATS SO FUCKING COOOOLOLOOOOOOO ASSRRRRHHHHH is that top 3 scenes of any film ever made anywhere in the world ??? shit man it might be !!! n that one where baahu jumps up in the air n the clouds form his dads face brother HOW IS RAJAMOULI REALLLLL HOW DO U EVEN CREATE THAAAATTTT\n\nmissed the title card cos they didn’t show any ads at my cinema 💔💔💔😭😭💔😭💔😭😭💔 im so heartbroken \n\nlife update ! \n\nlife has been really good to me lately (hope i don’t jinx anything)\n\ni’ve made a few new friends lately n gotten so much closer to my old friends too i don’t think ive ever felt so loved before i am surrounded by so many good people dude\n\nwent to switzerland for my anna’s beautiful beautiful surprise proposal n at the after party i had this moment where i jus saw everyone all of anna and anni’s friends and relatives chilling together having fun drinking reminiscing and it was one of those times where u realise that everything’s going to be okay yk not to get all sentimental out of nowhere but that holiday healed something in me \n\nfinally finally going out for halloween i even bought makeup n all that’s a childhood dream being ticked off 😫😫\n\ni also started doing my beard differently n i dont think ive ever loved how much i look ever in my life i feel so confident in myself bro \n\nanyway this movie was epic (get it guys 😭😂😭😂😭😂😭😂)",
