    "review": "BRAAAVVVVV IM SO GLAD I DOWNLOADED THE IMAX PRINT bro that scene where she rises up to the arena n the aspect ratio expands DONT TAKE THE PISSSSSS IVE NEVER SEEN THE LETTERBOXING GO AWAY LIVEO LIKE THAT THAT WAS SO HARDDDD \n\nu can tell it’s shot in imax bro idk what it was , that natural grain or the crazy composition or WHAT but the film jus had this crazy aura to it it was so pretty to look at , i loved it \n\nstoryline was fuuuckkkedddd asw the whole class divide theme was last movie is MUCHHHH more prominent here , espec when they have the winners going to each district n it shows these now very rich powerful high status ppl surrounded by ppl in the very depths of poverty , i thought it was a v powerful statement . or during that victory party where they offered them that pill that forced them to throw up just so they can scoff down more food , right after they showed all those scenes w the poor people rioting for better conditions nah come onnnn man . it has a bit of a rajamouli feel imo w all the people protesting n stuff . i like how they show that the capitol more than jus being rich are also parasitic bro like they find entertainment in these peoples suffering n turn it into an event , a game show n the entire audience at all these player interviews r all these rich ppl who are so out of touch w the fact that these r real life ppl literally fighting to save their own lives like they dont even view them as human which i find so intriguing . \n\nALSOOOO THE NEW GANEMASTER??? acc all of the tributes bro when they first snaked katniss i was like ☹️☹️☹️especially jeffrey weight i thought was soooo paavam bro but FUCK MEEEE THE WAY THEY FLIPPED IT ALL ON ITS HEAD AT THE END NAH UR TAKING THE PISSSSS like the way the ganemaster kept telling president snow to wait a bit it made it sound like he was tryna drag out their suffering but NAHHHH MAN SAID HES BEEN STAGING A COUP THIS WHOLE TIME WHAAAAAA HES COLDDDDD 😭😭😭like at the party when he said “ill see you again soon” or something idk i thought he was being a snarky prick BUT NOOOO HES THE GOATTTTT BLAD 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 genuinely got me so invested in the series now i came in for the romance n action in the first film but icl now im HEREEEE for the whole espionage political thriller vibe i usually never care for these kinda subplots like politics is so boring to me BUT BROOOO??? THEYRE KINDA COOKING HEREEEEE\n\nalso this movie gave me prisoner of azkaban vibes for some reason i think it’s jus the way this film kinda reveals that there’s a looootttt more going on behind the scenes the same way POA starts to unravel the real lore behind harry potter idk i thought that was bare sick . that and the slightly darker tone this film has asw nah im READDYYYYY TO WATCH THE REST MAN AND THE BOOKS TOO??? INVOLVE MEEEEE\n\nalso its so weird seeing woody harrelson w hair bro someone take that wig off him rn 😭😭😭\n\nquickly touching on peeniss again (guys were laughing at me for calling them that last time is that not their ship name ??? 😭😭😭) ik i sly don’t care ab the romance as much as the political themes but i found it rly endearing how even tho on the surface katniss is still v much putting on a show and acting a lot more affectionate than she really feels , but there r some quiet moments for explain on the train otw to the capitol or that one night where she’s bare scared n asks to hold him that you can TELLLLL A LIL SOMETHIJG SOMETHING IS FORMING THEREEE !!! cos peeta is lowk the only one who reaalllyyyy understands her like that like they got a soul connection yk , nobody’s gonna understnsd how katniss feels as well as peeta will cos he’s BEEN thru the same stuff . idk i find them bare cute . but i guess we’ll see how it pans out in the next movie 😝😝😝",
