    "rating": 4.5,
    "isRewatch": false,
    "isLiked": true,
    "isDiaryLogged": true,
    "review": "WOKKAAAALLIIIII ITHAAN DA CINEMA !!! \n\nbe prepared for a long flipping review to match this ginaminormous runtime bro i had to go pee four times 🙏🏽😭😭 i need to get that checked out lowk \n\nkutty storytime this is acc the second time i went cos the first time i went i tried weed w my friend before the show n greened the FUCK out before the trailers even finished 💔💔 #auraloss i’ve retired from weed forever now holy ptsd 😻😻\n\nanyway im SO glad i went a second time cos BRO??? THE REVIEWS WERENT LYIINGGG THIS IS SUCH A BANGER \n\nCHAPTER 1: REHMAN BALOCH \nakshaye khanna Wow. nah he’s fucking COOOLDDDD BRO obviously yk FA9LA was gonna be mentioned n in all honesty i only went for that one scene 😭😭 but no he’s INSANE bro he jus has that violent mysterious ruthless aura to him yk n all his mannerisms portray that so well like even his walk in his very first intro is just SCARY BRO HES SO SICK 😭😭😭 n the fa9la entry asw was EVEN HARDER in the cinema than in the reels bro COS HOW DO YOU LOOK SCARY EVEN WHEN UR JUS DANCING TO A SONG !!! \n\nCHAPTER 2: RANVEER SINGH\ni’ve loved ranveer ever since rocky aur rani cos that’s genuinely one of my fav comedy movies (the wakanda forever dialogue bffr 😭😭😭) n after i kept seeing him clips of him irl he just has this silly goofy hypeman energy to him n that’s kinda jus the image of him i had built up in my head yk? ive never seen any other of his movies so i ABSOLUTELY wasn’t expecting him to have this calculated quiet demeanour in the film AT ALL but i guess that just goes to show how much range he has . can’t wait to see more of his movies after this . i also REALLY appreciated how he allowed himself to be overshadowed yk, like again the fa9la entry scene i didnt even realise when i saw it on reels that ranveer is IN THAT SCENE bro like for a large part of the movie he allows himself to be thrashed and kind of a bum (flips that ALL AROUND BY THE SECOND HALF THO LOL) which is such a breath of fresh air after a string of tamil mass movies where the hero has to be aura boss no weakness whatsoever (lookin at u coolie) \n\nCHAPTER 3: THE VILLAINS\ni was NOTTTT expecting this to be as violent as it was bro i should’ve expected it when i saw rated 18 in the uk 😭😭 but FUCKKKK THAT MAJOR IQBAL SCENE?? i lowk wish i didn’t go in blind i would’ve liked having some type of warning before that scene bro omds 😭 but nah that one n that one rehman kill scene was so crazy dude i winced sooo many times . the villains were so well done bro cos they just ooze evil and seem to have no type of remorse whatsoever whether that’s towards others in the pakistani underworld or to india they’re violent asf .  i also liked how they highlighted corruption in the india govt too (the whole money plate subplot) \n\nCHAPTER 4: THE MUSIC\nWWWWW FUCKING ALBUM genuinely banger after banger after banger n it’s variiieddd too gehra hua is such a good chill song n then ishq jalakar n the title track r SOOO vibey n then ramba ho n naal nachna CLUB BANGWRS BRO THEYRE ALL COLD 😭😭😭😭😭😭 n don’t even get me STARTED ON FA9LA BRO DONT TAKE THE PISSSSSSS WHAT A BANGER !!! \n\nCHAPTER 5: GAAJI RATH\nwhy is everyone in this movie SO FUCKING LENG LOOOLLL bro ranveer wow 😻😻 clean up on aisle ME!!! that one scene where the guy sniffed his willy they shoulda casted me for that role brav 😻 but nah his air was BRAZY HIS HAIR FLIPS WERE SO FUNNY LOOOL n his beard n his EYES n icl why were his moobs so defined 😭😭😭 also all of the pakistanis bro major iqbal’s beard is acc the dream bro my mum would absolutely hate me but GOSH HE LOOKED GOOODDDD !!! ok enough being gay ! bro sara arjun icl 😭😭 sohaib kept calling her leng n ill be honest she DID look beautiful n she is our age now but i couldn’t stop thinking ab her role in deiva thirumugal like she’ll always be nila to me 😭\n\nSPOILERS!\n\nCHAPTER 6: GUNS AND ROSES\ndude chapter six of this movie?????? best part by a LONGGGG MILE coming straight off the intermission w this scene was fucking INSANE bro SO violent (obvs that major iqbal scene i mentioned) and the whole storming the office sequence too SO much aura SO much violence SO entertaining bro i was riding off the high of that chapter the entire rest of the film . i genuinely was starting to believe for a sec that hamza really was on pakistan’s side cos he went to such great lengths to save rehman n he pulls that off so well bro W ranveer again . the way he caught out that that chef was the one who snaked rehman asw n that entire torture sequence even calling sara arjun in the middle of it like bro this guy was fucking dedicated 😭😭😭 W chapter . oh yeah the chapter structure was also so cool it helped break up the runtime sooo well . didn’t feel like 3.5 hours at all \n\nCHAPTER 7: PROPAGANDA? \nokay hearrrr me out now cos i realise that this is based on true events and everything that they showed on screen really did happen but i and especially sohaib couldn’t help but feel like at times the portrayal of the muslims was a little over the top . like they spammed Allahu Akbar a billion times n me n soha n nadu were talking ab it and it defo felt like they were swaying away from the historical accuracy n anti-terrorism standpoint (which is GOOD) to a more anti-muslim point of view (not good 👎👎) . also they had a couple lines ab oh this indian govt is so bad i hope there’ll be a future good pm obviously referencing bjp which again ughhhh so unnecessary . also tryna claim pakistan is involved in every terrorist attack ever?? 🙄🙄\n\nCHAPTER 8: THE RED SCREEN\nthis part of the movie got REALLLLLL heavy and i got mad close to crying man there was a massive atmosphere of silence in the theatre . i was worried it would be kinda corny but they weaved it into the storyline so well and im GLAD they did that . a lot of brave decisions were put into this movie everything from the massive runtime to the red screen sequence too n i think it was v important for the message of the film to include that . \n\nANYWAYYYYY\nW movie , miiiighttt beat saiyaraa for best movie of the year for me ! it’s been a couple days n icl i really wanna watch it again 😭😭😭 absolutely CANNOT FUCKING WAIT FOR THE SEQUEL BRO THAT POST CREDIT SCENE WAS FUCKING CRAAZYZYZYZYZZY",
