    "review": "i didn’t watch the movie again dw 🙏🏽😭😭i jus wanted to do a year review type log idkkkk cos this year boxd wise has been so special for me\n\ni have made soooo many new friends and been exposed to so many new movies this apps rly changed who i am as a person imo n i will forever be grateful for everyone im friends w on this app , u guys all mean a lot to me ! 2024 was lowk one of my worse years but 25 could not have gone any better for me , i finally came out of my shell socially and sounding like a loser aside this app has been a big reason for that 😭 \n\nniki nadu deeksha madhu aleena medha varsha and everyone else i didn’t mention u guys have changed who rath is ! i’ve been so much happier as a person this year and so much less scared of going out n talking to people and the validation u guys give me everytime u comment on my logs it means more than i could ever describe 😭 i’ve even become more in tune w my culture both as a tamil and as an eelam person n looking back on who i was a year ago im so so happy to see how far ive come . my most liked review being that eelam documentary makes me so happy bro FREE EELAM FOREVA!!! n of course that depressing flipping 96 review looolll prolly the most vulnerable ive ever been in my entire life let alone on this app lol n i’ll appreciate u guys forever for allowing me to be so open on this app . \n\nim keeping this short cos im not tryna turn ts into another loser review but happy new year guys i love u alll !!! 🫶🏽🫶🏽🫶🏽",
