    "review": "tell me why my beard is the longest it’s been in a minute n my mum tells me i look like the hero from dhurandhar man said im doing up hamza ali masari cosplay 💔💔💔 NOT COMPLAINING THO RANVEER IN THIS MOVIE IS BUUUUFFFFFFF\n\nsoundtrack banger , destiny and jaiye sajna are so hard n i was iffy ab the fa9la replacement at first but icl now??? ADIII DII DII DIII DI DEEWAAAANNNN HOLY BANGER !!!! \n\ndidn’t feel long at all n genuinely only peed in the intermission bro do yk how weak my bladder is ?!? i’ve had to leave to pee more often for 2 hour movies but this one had me LOCKED IN in my seat the entire way thru \n\nthe football scene yeah love 🙏🏽😭\n\nuzair so leng , holy bromance in the first act tho wallah there were so many times i thought they were jus gonna have a quick makeout sesh 😭😭 \n\nmajor iqbal lowk aura loss 💔💔 he was so hard in first one but they sly nerfed him , i did like how they tried to humanise him w the stuff w his dad to tryna make him morally grey n all but at the same time this guys a terrorist bra who gaf if he had a bad upbringing jus show me more of his torture scenes wyd 😂😂😂\n\nsara arjun ultra leng n soooo good performance asw espec that confrontation scene , look how far nila has come !!! i feel so proud . not to bring up that #pussio again but dear SRV this is how u write a strong female character !!! adithya dhar was v respectful towards woman in both the movies despite the subject matter which i rly enjoyed . this is real love ! \n\nguys were saying this movie was doing too much aura farming fan service n normally id agree but FUCK YOUUUU BLAD KING OF LYARI ARE YOU NYUUUTTTSSSS 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 n the chapters man come on that was so cold w the subtitles and all man i dont gaf thats so fucking cool 😭😭 \n\nranveer’s character arc man , FAAACKKK 💔💔 i think at the core he just cherishes his family over everything , there’s 3 important scenes when he’s in a train (the start before aari aari, when he’s going to karachi, n the ending) n in each one they show a kid w his mum and u can also see ranveer slowly breaking down more n more across each scene as he strays further n further away from his family . i love the fourth wall break at the very end when he decides to leave his family after seeing they’ve moved on , i feel like he must be so conflicted inside cos in the end he did all of this to save his sister n his family but he also has to battle w the danger he could bring his family n also the fact they seem to finally be at peace , it was such an emotional moment i very nearly cried which i wasn’t expecting at all . honestly i thought the movie would end w him dying but i find this much more heartbreaking \n\nthere’s also his family in pakistan (yalina , his son , aalam) which feels like the only time he’s genuinely happy during his mission , the way he asks her to say his name during that final phone call asw he portrays that inner pain sosoooo well n the fact he lost BOTH his families (n burned his pictures w them too) i find so shattering man i wasn’t expecting such an emotional aspect to his story\n\nit did feel sly rushed despite being 4 hours espec in that second half , i defo think a trilogy woulda been better but im not complaining bro both these movies r still real cinema \n\nholy modi glaze 🎋 tryna make demonetisation look like it banged irl doooonttt take the piss 😭😭😭 idk indian politics like that but my economics brain was tweaaakinggg during that scene man , they completely ignored the impact it woulda had in rural areas that don’t have access to financial institutions close by , im not gonna turn this into an econ lecture but like come on man have shame 😭\n\naalam 💔💔 i ADOOOREDDD the scene of him killing aalam cos it’s ranveer acting AS jaskirat acting AS hamza being upset ab killing this spy , n u can see jassi’s performance kinda faltering (not ranveer’s) which is just UGHHHH SO WELL ACTED MANNN i love love love how u can see him breaking character cos he litr lost both his best friends on the same day , but he still has to uphold this hamza character thats such a difficult scene to act out n he did it SO WELL \n\nanyway much better experience than the first time i tried to watch part 1 ✌️😂 no greening out this time we drove to central instead n rode on the e-bikes licked W day !!! besides that work has been KILLING me bro i watched more movies last jan than i have from new years till april 😭😭😭 50 hour work weeks bro what the fuck am i doing w my life 😭 but easter holiday has acc jus been work n seeing the guys , reconnected w a lot of old friends too so holidays been v nice man\n\nlove u guys byeee",
